<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Ipunu Nyangu 2 (puu)</book>
  <para style="rem">Projet Nyangu</para>
  <para style="rem">Langue: Ipunu, Yipunu, Yipounou, Ipounou, Punu, Pounou.</para>
  <para style="rem">Membres de l'Equipe: André Paul KOMBILE KOMBILE Bastho; Julie MOUBOUENGOU; Alain Edouard Faël DOUKAGA MACKOBOU; Honorine BOUKANDOU;</para>
  <para style="rem">Conseiller: Paul D. HUMBER</para>
  <para style="rem">© CIEATLG LIBREVILLE 2024; Seed Company</para>
  <para style="h">Bisalu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bis</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bisalu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mughande wu Bisalu bi Bilumbi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mughande wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bisalu bi Bilumbi</para>
  <para style="imt">Dikotulu di mughande</para>
  <para style="im">Mughande wu Bisalu bi Bilumbi witsinguli mambu amamaduke mughande wu Musamu Wuboti wu Djesu awu Luke amarende. Witsinguli nane Bilumbi, diwendili yiri abamatindu na Djesu, bamanyavisile musamu andi. Bamaléwusamune o musyengi Serusaleme, na mu binange abivu mu mughule, mbana mu malongu amatsyengile mubu Mediterane. Anane bamadughusulu yisalu ayi Djesu amabaveghe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk 24.47-48</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1-2">1—2</ref></char> Va dibandu di Mughande wu Bisalu bi Bilumbi, Djesu emati o djulu ombu Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9">1.9</ref></char>). Avave, esa va mosi nowu nane abetsili, tumbe ebatindili Yinyuni Yisyeme, ayiruyili ombu Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2">2</ref></char>). Yinyuni yeni yibawamusi usamune mambu maneni ame Nzambi edughusu. Ubongile kodu na kodu mughande eni, Yinyuni Yisyeme ebeyisi djowu ababene vayile Djesu yitu. Ubongile o kapu tegha teno kapu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12">12</ref></char>, yilumbi Pyere adji mutu awuvu nzume mu momevosu mu bisalu bi bilumbi.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 3-7">3—7</ref></char> Badukitsi ba Djesu badji baSwife. Bakiwende o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi dji Serusaleme na bévosi mu Fumu owu Djesu. Tumbe nane djandi, bane purulu na bivunde bi baSwife.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8-12">8—12</ref></char> Bango yitu bewendi mbure tsyotsu mu Sudé, o Samari tena o vale. Bésamuni Musamu Wuboti ombu batu botsu na ombu djowu abagha baSwife. Dyoni dyambu dineni di ghone. Mu temu eni, bu baSwife bamadjabaange Nzambi dji muvingu. Bamatasaange yiri batu ba bingange bi susu mbé baghorungule uvayile Nzambi baSwife yitu. Tumbe Djesu Kirisete eveyi musughe ombu batu botsu wu ube na dinonge na Nzambi. Mabuli ma <char style="em">bakereti</char>, diwendili rye dibundu di Djesu Kirisete diburu. Yike wufune difuni, na dimabase na baSwife na abagha baSwife.</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bd">Kapu</char> <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13-28">13—28</ref></char> Ubande va kapu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13">13</ref></char>dibuku dilasi viri viri bisalu bi yilumbi Pole. Djandi amanengulu na Djesu Kirisete mu kapu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9">9</ref></char>. Dibundu di Antyose dji Siri dimamusole na abesali nandi konge mu usamune Musamu Wuboti wu Djesu. Bakapu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13">13</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 28">28</ref></char> bétsinguli milingu mi bisalu byandi. Tsitsinguli tsyeni Musamu wumanyavile mu mughule mubu Mediterane teno Rome, musyengi awuvyoghulile myotsu mu bukaghe bwotsu.</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="im">Musamu Wuboti wu Djesu Kirisete mu Luke wilasi temu andi. Na mughande wu Bisalu bi Bilumbi, temu dibundu dji bandi. Adjidji temu adji abavu na yitu mu Djesu bésamunini mbure tsyotsu yi djandi la Kirisete, omarumu na Nzambi. Bésamuni ombu batu ba mitsanu myotsu na mabundu motsu, ombu bangebi na bivunde, ombu bisine na bidjaghe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Dibandu di mughande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Mundumbe Tofile, mu mughande ami wuteghe, nyimawulase motsu ame Djesu amadughusungu nolonzaange vane dibandu <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>tena yilumbu ayi amamatile o djulu. Mu yilumbu yeni, na mangolu ma Yinyuni Yisyeme, amaveghe marume mu botsu abe amasole mube bilumbi. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Va djulu dufu dwandi, amalabene monyu nowu. Mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilumbu, amabalasaange yi ngenze adji monyu. Mu temu eni, amalonzaange mambu ma Bukaghe bu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Ave amabile nowu va mulambu, amabatsingule rye: «Syalanu wune musyengi Serusaleme, na dukelise pangini adji Tate amadulonze, adji mebeni nyimadutsingule kale. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>San amabatise na mambe, tumbe djenu, mu mwa pesu bilumbu, dubatusu mu Yinyuni Yisyeme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dubatusu mu Yinyuni Yisyeme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wubase na Yinyuni Yisyeme, vo Nzambi etindi Yinyuni yandi muyitsane mu batu.</char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Djesu amasile badukitsi bandi na amamate o djulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Djowu bamaghukeme na bamawivule Djesu rye: «Fumu, mu temu edjine wubyatsu kaghe mukute Yisrayele, mumbari wukeghabughe bulongu buneni nane va teghe?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Amabawaghule rye: «Dyambu dyenu tsiri udjabe batemu na maweru ame Tadji ami amatsonzighe mu ditase dyandi.» <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Tumbe dudile mangolu, Yinyuni Yisyeme yusundughe mu djenu, na dube bambedji bami ubandile o musyengi Serusaleme, o yinange yi Sudé, o yinange Samari teno masukusulu ma butambe.<verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Yike emani uvose moni, amamatusu o djulu na va wusu owu, amatsyemughe o ghari madudumbi. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Nenane djowu bamatsuninaange o djulu ave Djesu amenematilaange, babaale babedji na bidwaru biveme bamasundile wulabene nowu. <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>Na bamavose nowu rye: «Bise Ngalile, dibandu yi dwisutulu na ughengile o djulu? Djesu adjitsimatusu o djulu va ghari enu, oghabughe munongu mosi nane atsimatile.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Matyase evinzi Sudase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Bilumbi bamadusughe mukongu awinengulu Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mukongu awinengulu Olive: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">vadji miri miburi milunde minengulu Olive o bulongu bu Yisrayele.</char></note>, na bakeghabughe o musyengi Serusaleme. Mukongu eni umabe va dyasu diveghu musughe ulinge yilumbu yi duvumu yi baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Banotole o musyengi Serusaleme, bakemate o yibuku yi ndaghu ayi djulu, nane na kale. Vamabe Pyere, San, Sake na Andere, Filipe na Tome, Batelemi na Mati, Sake mwane Alefé, Simu awu benengili Selote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simu awu benengili Selote: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">djandi awu amabe mu yinombu yi bobamavovenaange na beni mudile dudjeghusu.</char></note>, na Sudase mwane Sake. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Djobotsu bamabengunungu temu na temu va mosi mu dusambu, na baghetu, na Mari ngudji Djesu, na baane ba ngudji ba Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Mu bilumbu byeni, Pyere amareleme va ghari owu. Durangu du botsu dumabe kame na maghumi-mabedji (120). Na akevose rye: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Baane ba tadji, diwelimine yi pangini adjimabighu mu Bisonu bi Nzambi djuduwusu. Mu Bisonu byeni, Yinyuni Yisyeme amavose vane kale mu munu Davide, mu dyambu di Sudase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sudase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adjinengulu «Yikalyote».</char></note>, awu amabe yibeghe ndonge yi abamarughe o uyighaange Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Dibaale dyédine, amabe wumosi va ghari etu, na amasalaange va mosi netu. <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Na mbongu atsi amadile mu bukongu bwandi, amasumbe nungi andi. O ghari nungi eni amaberuyile maghuwusu, modji andi wuke pasighe na misopu myotsu mikebe layini va tsi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Batu botsu ba musyengi Serusaleme bamadiwulu, la dibandu o mbembu owu, bamanengilile nungi eni “Akeldama” diwendi yiri: “Nungi malungu”.» <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Na Pyere amabwele rye: «Mu mughande Nyimbu, disonu rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Batu badusuyi mu ndaghu andi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">na vayabe mutu wutsane mu djoni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Nim 69.26</ref></char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Na disonu rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Mutu mususu abongi mbure andi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Nim 109.8</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>Vengu tusolanu wumosi va ghari botsu abamayenewendaange konge netu, temu djotsu Fumu Djesu amanangilaange bulongu netu. <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>Amabe netu ubandile temu adji San amabatisile Djesu, tena yilumbu ayi amamatile o djulu. Kaboghu, mutu mosi mu yinombu mbé obe mbedji netu, dji durambughu du Djesu o dufu.» <verse eid="ACT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Bamalase batu babedji: Sosefe awu bamanengilaange «Baresabase», dine dyandi dimosi «Susutuse» na Matyase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Bakevaghe dusambu dwedudu: «Fumu, widjabi mirime mi botsu. Tulasi ndebeni, anyi mu mubedji éwuwu, wusole. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Djandi obe yilumbi, na obonge yisalu va yivinze yi Sudase, omayisile mughabughe o mbure adjimabe djandi.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Va djulu vane, bakebwaghe mbande, na Matyase akebwesu mu yinombu yi dighumi na yilumbi yimosi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Durughulu du Yinyuni Yisyeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Ave yilumbu yi mumengu Patekote yimatolile, bango yitu bamabe baghukeme mbure mosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Sundila, nduku djimarughe o djulu, djimabe nane mungudi wuneni. Nduku eni djimabase ndaghu adji bamabe baghukemine. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Kaboghu, bakelabe ndimi nane milutsu mi mudji. Tsikekakunu, tsikesundughe na tsiketsane mu kale mutu.<figure style="fig" alt="Durughulu du Yinyuni Yisyeme" file="WA03939b.tif" size="col" loc="2.1-4" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2.3"/> <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Botsu bamabasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme na bamabande uvose mambembu masusu, nane Yinyuni amaveyilaange kale mutu mumavose.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>O Serusaleme, wumabe baSwife bamayitsaange Nzambi, bamarughesene mu malongu motsu ma butambe. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Ave bamawululu nduku eni, yinombu yi batu yikeghukeme. Yimakambulu tinde ukambulu, mumbari kale mutu amabaghulungu uvose mu dilongu dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Bamasutu na bakebanyungilaange, novosaange rye: «Batu bebabe, bise Ngalile! <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Yike tsyeni twibaghululu, uvose dilongu di mutu-mutu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Va ghari etu, bamosi bise Patese, Medese, Elame, Mesopotami, o Sudé na Kapadose, basusu bise Pon na Asi, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Firisi, Pafili, Yisipete, bamosi o musyengi wu Libi adji bambene na Sirene, na botsu abamarughesene o Rome, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>bise Kerete na Arabi. Va ghari etu, bane bamaburu baSwife, abane wandi bamarughesene o malongu masusu, bamavayile Nzambi baSwife yitu. Yike tsyeni twibaghululu uvose maboti ma Nzambi mu mambembu metu.» <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Botsu bamasutu na bamaghambu na dyuvose. Bamakewivulaange yiri: «Adidi tsyé diwendili?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Tumbe basusu, bamapedjingi botsu abamasinge Nzambi novose rye: «Badji mu malangi!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere evosili mughungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Pyere na dighumi na yilumbi yimosi, bamareleme va ghari mughungi, na Pyere akevose rye: «Bise Sudé, na djenu botsu abe dwitsani o Serusaleme, wulwanu adivyoyi na dyo ngadutsingule, limbighanu matudji. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Batu beni babe bagha balange nane dwitasili, mumbari wisi aki kedi. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Tumbe vave, adimavosu na mubiyitsi Sowele:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>“Mu bilumbu bi musitu, me Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">nyuveghe Yinyuni yami mu batu botsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Baane benu babaale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">na ba baghetu bobighaange.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Minzambu myenu myulabaange biryaryamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mba binunu byenu byudoraange bandosi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Nine, mu bilumbu byébine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">nyusunze Yinyuni yami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">mu basalitsi bami botsu ba babaale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">na ba baghetu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">Djowu botsu bobighaange.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Menu nyulase bimaghe o djulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">na bilimbe mu butambe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">vobe malungu, mudji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">na dimungi di nzumbili.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Nyangu djutsime nokalughe piseme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">na tsungi djubenge nane malungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ne yilumbu yi Fumu yike rughe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">yilumbu ayube yineni mba yirange.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Yike batu botsu abonengile Fumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">boghobulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Sow 3.1-5</ref> </char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>Bise Yisrayele, wulwanu adi menu ngadutsingule. Djesu mwise Nasarete amabe mutu awu Nzambi amadulase munongu andi. Amadivaghe ave amamuveyile musughe wuvaghe bimaghe na bilimbe bi mangolu. Djandi amadughusu va ghari enu nane djenubeni dwididjabili. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Nane djabeni Nzambi amakunzile mu dughanu dwandi ne mambu meni makelabene, djenu dumaghangise Djesu na batu baghane yitu, bakemughomine nomuboke va kurusu. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Tumbe Nzambi amamudjeyise mu maghughe ma dufu, akemughabuse monyu, mumbari Djesu mbé aghorungule ughangu na mangolu ma dufu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Kaghe Davide amavose mu djandi rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Nyimalabaange Fumu va wusu ami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">o mabaale mami, mumba ngéregheme.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Ladibandu, murime ami wumabile mu nzangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">na munu ami wiwimbili na yinyunge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Ne dunyuru dwami dube dubase na yitu,<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>mumbari Fumu aghonzile o bulongu bu bobafu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">na wughogharu bwé Yibyatsi yaghu Yisyeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">yikebungene wusulemughe o ghari mbine.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Wumandase manzile amebeyi o monyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">wumbase na nzangu ave nyubile va wusu aghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Nim 16.8-11</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>Baane ba tadji, menu nine musughe wudutsingule na bureti mu dyambu di kaaghe etu Davide. Djandi amafu, na amatswighu na mbine andi djikilabene tena vave, va ghari etu. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Djandi amabighe mumba amadjabaange yiri Nzambi amaleve pesi mu djabeni bwé, wumosi mu bateghule bandi obe yivinze yandi va yitsighe yi bukaghe. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Mu posulu eni, Davide amabighe durambughulu du Kirisete o dufu. Adine amavosile rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“Asamamusile o bulongu bu bobafu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">na dunyuru dwandi dusamabole o ghari mbine<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Nim 16.10</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Djesu eni nyiranguni, Nzambi amamughabuse monyu. Djetu botswanu tudji bambedji. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Tate Nzambi amamatise Djesu o mabaale mandi. Djandi amamuveghe Yinyuni Yisyeme ayimavangenu. Djawandi amatupuyile yoni, adine dwilabi nowulu vave. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Davide djabeni asamamate o djulu, tumbe amavose rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Fumu Nzambi amatsingule Fumu ami yiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Yitsane omabale mami,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>tena nyusunze bavinitsi baghu otsi makulu maghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Nim 110.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>Mukute wotsu wu Yisrayele widjabi na bureti yiri Nzambi amamubyatse Fumu na Kirisete. Djesu édjine adji dutsi ghomine noboke va kurusu.»<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bango yitu bateghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Bapikile ba botsu abamawulu mbembu édjine baketsyemughe, na bamawivule Pyere na bilumbi bimosi yiri: «Bane ba tadji, yike tsyeni turungule wuvayile?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Pyere amabawaghule rye: «Fungulanu nodunde mabi menu, na kale mutu mbé obatusu mu dine di Djesu Kirisete. Vaghanu nane, mabi menu motandu, na dukedile Yinyuni Yisyeme. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Nzambi amaghane wudivaghe ombu bane benu, djenubeni, na botsu abetsani o malongu mavale, batu botsu nane Fumu Nzambi obanengilile.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Pyere amabwévose pwele mambu, na amabawarise novose rye: «Singanu dughobutsu mumbari monyu enu, wukekakene na mutsanu wubive wu bulongu bwébubu!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Botsu abamawulu nosinge mbembu Pyere, bamabatusu. Mu yilumbu yeni, tangudji tosini-yiryeru (3 000) tsi batu bamasobene nowu mu yinombu.<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibundu diteghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Temu tsyotsu, bamawulungu ndonzulu bilumbi na musighe, bakebeghange monyu dibure-ngudji, bamadjangaange nosambilaange va mosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Kale mutu amawulungu keri, mumbari Nzambi amadughusungu pwele bilimbe na bimaghe mu nzalusulu bilumbi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Bango yitu botsu bamabangaange mbure mosi na bamaghabenaange byotsu abimabangaange byowu. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Bamasumbisaange maboti mowu, na bakeghabenaange badoli djobotsu, nane kale mutu amabilaange na nzale. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Bilumbu byotsu, na murime mosi, bamaghukemange o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi. Bameneghabaange bighudji mu mandaghu mowu na bamadjangaange na nzangu na murime pwelele. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Bamayitsaange Nzambi na mukute wotsu wumabanyungilaange. Na Fumu amabwesaange kale yilumbu mu yinombu yowu botsu abe amaghobulaange.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Dubelusu du yikoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Mwa yilumbu, va murekemunu wisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">murekemunu wisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maweru maryeru ma tsisighe.</char></note>, Pyere na San bamawendaange o ndaghu Nzambi, va diweru di dusambu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Lake, bamatsyetaange dibaale dimaburu yikoyi, awu amasunzungu kadi yilumbu va dikotulu di ngande ndaghu Nzambi, va mune ndaghu awinengulu «Diwuyi Diboti». Djandi amavondaange mbongu na yingebe, ombu djowu abamakotaange o ghari ndaghu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Anolabe Pyere na San bwé yikukote bakekote o ghari ngande eni, dibaale dyeni, akebavonde mbongu. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Pyere djone San bakemughengise na bakemutsingule yi: «Tutsuni.» <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Djandi akebatsune, amatase yiri odile mwa yime mu djowu. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Tumbe Pyere akemutsingule rye: «Ngane badoli vo lore, tumbe ayivu nami, nyighuve yoni. Mu dine di Djesu Kirisete mwise Nasarete, releme na wende!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Akemughaange mu dikake dyandi di mabaale, akemurelighe. Vane-vane, matambi mandi na bapanzi bandi bikesundile wuware, <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>akereleme fungelini na akebande uwende. Amakote nowu o ghari ngande ndaghu Nzambi, amayenewendaange djabeni, amayenedumughaange, noyitsaange Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Mukute wotsu wumamulabe uwende, noyitse Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Bamamudjabaange yiri djandi awu amabangaange atsane va Diwuyi Diboti di ndaghu Nzambi, mu vondaange mbongu. Banolabe adimamuruyile, batu bamakambulu na bamasutu. <verse eid="ACT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Tumbe djandi, asamamwékakene na Pyere na San. Mukute wotsu wumawende mbangu wukebakande o dulombili du ngande ndaghu Nzambi, o Pyasu dji Salemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pyasu dji Salemu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbure djivu o ghari ngande ndaghu djirungu na bivale.</char></note>, bamasutu.<verse eid="ACT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere wuvove-evovi va wusu mughungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Ave Pyere amalabile nane, akevosile mughungi yi: «Batu ba Yisrayele, mumba yi dumasutulu mu aditsilabene? Yi dwitutsunini, nane bwé mu mangolu metu vo yitu yetu, mutu éwuwu atsirelemine?<verse eid="ACT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Nesi, tumbe Nzambi Aberaame, adji Nzambi Yisaake, Nzambi Sakobe na Nzambi baghulu betu, amabase Djesu musalitsi andi na bundumbe. Djesu eni adji dumasumbise ombu Pilate na dumamughale va wusu andi. Nenane Pilate mbé amudjeyisile. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Yine dumamughale, djandi awu asyeme na asungeme. Va yivinze yandi, dumavonde musughe wudjeyise yikongu. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Mu dyoni, dumaboke oyive monyu, tumbe Nzambi atsimurambuse o dufu, tudji bambedji. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Kaboghu, dwilabi mutu éwuwu na dwimudjabi. Mu dine di Djesu atsiwarusulu, mumbari djetu twivali Djesu yitu. Mu yitu mu Djesu atsibelusu djandi wotsu, va wusu djetu botsu.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>Na vave, baane ba tadji, nyidjabi yiri dutsighambu na dudjabu mu nzalesulu tsyenu, nane bivunde byenu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Nzambi amadidughusu nane djabeni amadikunzile va dibandu mu munu babiyitsi botsu yi Kirisete adji otinde, otsoghusu. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Kaboghu, fungulanu mabi menu na ghabughanu manzinzimze, mumbari mabi menu maketsindulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Anane Fumu oduveghile duvotsu, na odutindile djandi awu amasolu, Djesu Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Diwelimine bwé Djesu mbé olebe o djulu na Nzambi, tena yilumbu ayi mambu motsu moghabuyile maghone, nane Nzambi amavosile mu munu babighitsi bandi basyeme. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Dingenze Moyise amavose: “Fumu Nzambi enu odupalisile va ghari mukute enu mubiyitsi nane menu. Dumuwululu mu motsu ame odutsingule. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Wotsu owubuse uwulu mubiyitsi, oboku na obungu va ghari mukute Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Babiyitsi botsu, ubandile va Samwele na botsu abamarughe va yinzime yandi, bamavose djowandi mu temu adjidji tuvu anu. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Djenu dudji baane ba babiyitsi, mba bibyalile bi disyale adi Nzambi amavangene na baghulu betu. Lanu adi Nzambi amatsingule Aberaame: “Bifumbe byotsu bi butambe na bakule bowu, bodile myule<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Dib 22.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Pangini édjidji adji enu, adjimarombise Nzambi utinde musalitsi andi muduveghe myule, nodukakene mu mabi menu.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Pyere na San bésikughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Bavaghulitsi ba paghu na yivunde yi baghore abamakelisaange ndaghu Nzambi, na bise dibuli di baSadisi bamaruyile ave Pyere djone San bamavosilaange mughungi. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Djobotsu bamabase na kabu djineni, mumbari bamalabe Pyere djone San ulonze mukute yi: botsu abafu wandi boghabughe monyu, nane Djesu amaghabuyile monyu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Bakebaghaange na bakebabwaghe o tsughu tena kedi, mumbari wisi mbé wumatsime. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Tumbe, bapwele va ghari botsu abamawulu mbembu Nzambi, bakesinge ube bango yitu. Durangu dwowu dumabe tangudji tosini-yiranu (5 000) tsi batu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Va kedi, bidjeti, bivunde bi baSwife na milonzi mi mighaghe bakeghukeme o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Va ghari owu vamabe: Ane yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, Kayife, San, Alesandere na botsu abamabe mu mukute yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Bakebeghe bilumbi va wusu owu na bakebawivule rye: «Mu musughe nyi vo mu dine di nyi dutsidivayile?»<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Pyere, abasulungu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, akebatsingule rye: «Djenu bidjeti bi mukute na bivunde bi baSwife, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>djetu tutsivaghe diboti ombu djandi awu abetsi yikoyi. Na nyangu yike wuwivule dwituwivuli, tsyeni dibaale dyédine ditsidilile dubelusu? <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Djenu botsu na mukute wotsu wu Yisrayele, dune dyambu dimosi adi mbé durungule udjabe: mu dine di Djesu Kirisete mwise Nasarete, dibaale adivu va wusu enu atsi dilile dubelusu. Djesu Kirisete adji djenu dumaghomine va kurusu, Nzambi akemughabuse monyu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Mu Dibuku di Mbembu Nzambi direndu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“Dimani adi djenu barungitsi dumabwaghe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">dimakalughe yike dimani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">adi neni adi siki yibughe yi ndaghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Nim 118.22</ref></char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 4:11">Djesu la dimani dyeni. <verse eid="ACT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Djandi wandi pinze, awu orungulu wutughobule. Adine, mu bulongu bwotsu, Nzambi asamaveghe mutu susu, awu djetu botwanu tughobululu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Bidjeti byeni bike kambulu, binolabe Pyere djone San bévosi na musighe. Vane-vane, bimabwélabe yiri badji batu ba kulini, abasamanenge mba baghane dudjabu. Djowu, bamabadjabaange bwé bamayenewendaange na Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Tumbe, ave bamalabilaange yikoyi ayi mabelusu, diteli va mughule bilumbi, bidjeti byeni bisamadile adi uvose. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Kaboghu, baketsingule bilumbi yi: «Palanu o ndaghu dusosusu!» Na bakesyale djobeni notsunde. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Bakewivusenaange: «Yike tsyeni turungule wuvayile batu bebabe? Dingenze, bamavaghe yimaghe, batu botsu ba musyengi Serusaleme bamadidjabe, na tughorungule udighale. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Tumbe, turungule uvaghe yiri yilumbi yéyine yikényave va ghari mukute. Kaboghu, tubaghandisyanu nobanyangile bwé bayabwé bile uvosile mutu wotsu mu dine di Djesu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Lake bakenengile Pyere na San, nobatsingule rye: «Duyabwévose vo ulonze mu dine di Djesu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Tumbe Pyere na San bamabawaghule rye: «Va wusu Nzambi, yi yisungeme: wudughobise djenu, vo wughobise Nzambi? Sosanu djenubeni! <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Tumbe mu djetu, tughorungule ubuse uvose nolonze mu motsu ame tumalabe nowulu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Bidjeti byeni bike bwévale Pyere na San mapemi maghone na bakebadunde, basamadile tonu djubakilisile. Yike mukute wotsu wumawimbilaange noyitse bundumbe bu Nzambi dibandu yimaghe ayimalabene. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Dibaale adimabelusu na yimaghe yéyine mbé amavyoghe maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime bi duburu.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dusambu du bango yitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Pyere djone San banodundu, bamawende kwase uyélabe bambatsi bowu, noyebatsingule motsu ame bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, na bivunde bi baSwife bamabatsingule. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Banomane ughuwulu ame Pyere na San bamabatsingule, djobotsu bamasambile Nzambi na murime wumosi, novose rye: «Mulonzi, ndedju wumasunde djulu, butambe, mubu na byotsu abivu mune. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Ndedju, mu munu Davide kaaghe etu, musatsi aghu awumabase na Yinyuni Yisyeme, wumavose rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“Mumbari yi mikute mimanyoyile?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Mba mitungili Nzambi fundu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">tumbe mambu motsu mane ma nzolu.<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Bakaghe ba butambe bamakunzeme mutoghe divite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">bidjeti bimawulusunu mube mimbini mi Fumu Nzambi na Kirisete andi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Nim 2.1-2</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Dingenze, Yirode ayi Atipa na Ponze Pilate djowandi, bamaghukeme o musyengi éwuwu, djone beni na mukute Yisrayele, mu toyise Djesu. Djandi awu amabe musatsi awusyeme, awu ndebeni wumasole nane Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Yike bamadughusu motsu ame ndebeni, mu matase na mangolu maghu, wumakunze vane dibandu. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Avave Fumu, labe nane bétukwanini, na veghe bisatsi byaghu mangolu moyenetsingulaange nolonze mbembu aghu na duvotsu vo na musighe. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Kaboghu, lase mangolu maghu yi va ghari etu vakelabene biryaryamu, bimaghe, dubelusu na bilimbe bimosi mu dine di musalitsi aghu Djesu, djandi odjivu asyeme.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Ave bamamanine wusambile, butambe bumaregheme va mbure adji bamabe. Djobotsu bakebase na Yinyuni Yisyeme na bamayenetsingulaange mbembu Nzambi na musighe.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bango yitu béwamusini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Botsu abamakalughe bango yitu, bamawulusunungu, na dinonge di murime na ditase dimabe diware va ghari owu. Vagha mutu amavosaange rye: «Bime abibi, abyami!» Tumbe, bamaghabenaange byotsu abi bamadilaange. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Yike na mangolu maneni, bilumbi bamayenesamunaange durambughulu du Fumu Djesu o dufu. Mba yese yi Nzambi yimalabenaange na mangolu mu kale mutu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Vasamabe mutu va ghari owu amaghambu na yime, mumbari botsu abamabe na banungi vo mandaghu, bamamasumbisaange na bamabeghaange badoli beni botsu <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>ombu bilumbi. Lake djowu bamatsighabaange, na kale mutu amadilaange dyandi dikabu. <verse eid="ACT 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Nane yibaghunu yi dibaale bamanengilaange Sosefe, amabe na nungi. Djandi awu bilumbi bamalughe yike Barenabase, diwendili yi: «Mutu awiwarisi», amabaange musalitsi wu dilongu di Levi, mwise Sipere. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Akesumbise nungi andi, akebeghe madila na akimaveghe bilumbi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ananyase na Safire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Tumbe dibaale dimanengulungu Ananyase, na mughatsi andi Safire, bakesumbise nungi mosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Banowulusunu, bakesweghe dikabu di mbongu, na bakelase dikabu adimasyale ombu bilumbi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Pyere akemuwivule rye: «Ananyase, tsyé dyabu amabasile murime aghu nane? Wumafure Yinyuni Yisyeme, mba wumasweghe dikabu di mbongu atsi dutsidile mu nungi enu. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Ne wukedjisumbise tsya djibetsi djaghu? Wuno dji sumbise, ughabetsi na musughu wubonge badoli baghu? Yike tsyeni, wutsibile na ditase divelughe nane o ghari murime aghu? Tsi batu wutsifure, tumbe Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Yike edighulu, Ananyase akeberughe na akesuke muvumu. Mba botsu abamadiwulu bakeghangu na dunzyenzi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Minzambu bakibonge mvumbi, bakedji pyete noyetswighe.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Tangudji maweru maryeru manovyoghe, mughatsi Ananyase akerughe, asamadjabe adimavyoghe. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pyere akemuwivule yi: «Nzinguli, dufunu adu dutsisumbisile nungi enu adudu?» Akewake: «Yine, adune.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Kaboghu Pyere akemutsingule rye: «Tsyé dutsiwulusununu mumange Yinyuni yi Fumu? Wulu! Abatsiyetswighe mulumi aghu, bake va mune ndaghu, bowubeghe ndewandi.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Vane-vane akeberughe va makulu ma Pyere na akesuke muvumu. Minzambu mikekote, mikemurasunu amafu, mikemunangule na bakeyémutswighe va mughule mulumi andi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Dibundu dyotsu na botsu abamamawulu bakeghangu tindi na dunzyenzi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimaghe bipwele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Bimaghe na bilimbe bipwele bimavaghungu na bilumbi va ghari mughungi. Bango yitu bamatsanaange va mosi o Pyasu Salemu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Djobotsu bamabaghobisaange pwele, yotsu yine, vagha ne mutu wumosi wumarondaange wusobene nowu. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Baghetu na babaale bapwele, abamavayile Fumu yitu bamafunaange temu tsyotsu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Adine bamabeyilaange bibedu, mba bakebasunzaange mu tsyengi vo mu matoghu mu manzile. Bamavayilaange nane, mumbari ave Pyere ovyoyile, yidumbitsi yandi yikewumbe ne wumosi va ghari owu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Yinombu yineni yimarughaange o misyengi amibambene na Serusaleme. Yinombu yeni yimaghukeme o musyengi Serusaleme. Aghune, bamabeghaange bibedu, na batu abamakwanungu na binyuni bibive, na botsu bamabelughaange.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilumbi bikwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Kaboghu, yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na botsu abamabe nandi, diwendi yi na dibuli di baSadisi, bakebalabe ngusu na bakeghane kake. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Va wusu batu botsu, bakebaghaange na bakebabwaghe o tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Tumbe, vane mukolu, yanze yi Fumu yikedibule mune ndaghu, yikebapalise. Yanze yeni, yikebatsingule rye: <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Wendanu o ndaghu Nzambi, na tsingulanu mukute mambu motsu ma monyu wughone.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Bilumbi banomawulu, bamawende kedi neni o ndaghu Nzambi na bamalonzaange.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na botsu abamabe nandi, bakerughe na bakeghukighe fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife na bivunde bi dibundu di mukute Yisrayele. Bamatinde batu muyélande bilumbi o tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Tumbe baghore banotole, basamabarasune o tsughu. Bakeghabughe ombu bidjeti muyebatsingule bikumbu. Na bakevose yi: <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Tutsirasene tsughu dji dibeme na burange, kale ghore abe va mbure andi va wusu byabutsu. Tumbe ave tutsidjidibulile, tugharasene mutu o ghari.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Banodighulu, yivunde yi baghore ba ndaghu Nzambi na yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu bakekambulu nokewivule adimavyoghe.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Mba mutu akibatsingule yi: «Wulwanu! Batu abe dutsisunze o tsughu, badji o ndaghu Nzambi obélonzili batu mambu mowu.» <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Vane-vane yivunde yi baghore ba ndaghu Nzambi akewende na batu bandi muyéghange bilumbi. Tumbe basamavaghe buvape, mumba bamadumange yi mughungi wukébatinde mamani. <verse eid="ACT 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Banobabeghe, bakebawakise ombu fundu dji banzonzi. Yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu akebafundise. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>Djandi akebatsingule yi: «Tumadughandise kile-kingi ulonze mu dine di mutu ewune. Tumbe yi dumavaghe? Dumanyavise ndonzulu enu ombu batu botsu abetsani o musyengi Serusaleme, mba dwirondi usunze dufu du Djesu va djulu muru etu!» <verse eid="ACT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Pyere na bilumbi bimosi, bakebawaghule yi: «Diwelimine yi tughobisaange Nzambi, tsiri batu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Nzambi baghulu betu amarambuse Djesu adji djenu dumaghomine va kurusu mu muboke. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Nzambi amamumatise o mabaale mandi, mba amamubyatse Yidjeti na Mughobutsi. Amavayile nane, muveghe Yisrayele yese yukalughe dyele nodile dutandu du mabi mandi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Tudji bambedji ba mambu meni, djetu na Yinyuni Yisyeme ayi Nzambi amaveghe abemughobisi.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Bivunde bi fundu dji banzonzi banowulu nane, bakenyoghe tinde unyoghe tena bamaronde ubabokise. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Tumbe va ghari owu, vamabe muFarisi wumanengulungu Ghamalyele, mulonzi mighaghe wumaghobusungu na batu botsu. Djandi akereleme va ghari fundu dji banzonzi na akevaghe bakepalise bilumbi mwa temu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Mba aketsingule dibundu yi: «Bise Yisrayele, kebenanu na adi dwirondi uvaghe batu beni bane. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Vasekabe yitsingu tumalabe Tedase ureleme vave, amavumbaange wube yidjeti. Tangudji vamabe ne kame-djine (400) tsi batu bamasobene nandi. Tumbe akeboku, botsu abamamuduke baketsyamughe mba vasamasyale ne yisalu mu dighane dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Va djulu vane, va temu sanzeme, tumalabe Sudase mwise Ngalile, amadute tinde bapwele nandi. Tumbe akeboku djawandi, na botsu abamamuduke baketsyamughe. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Vave nyidutsinguli: duyamwéghengile ame bévayi, basilyanu bayenewende. Mumba payi matase mowu na bisalu birambuyili ombu batu, byutsyemughe. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Tumbe payi birambuyili ombu Nzambi, dughorungule ubipanze. Duyakubene utoghe na Nzambi». Bise dibuli dyeni bakeghululu Ghamalyele. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Bakenengile bilumbi, bakebadimbise na mangwangu, bakebaghandise urangune dine di Djesu mba bakebadunde.<verse eid="ACT 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Bilumbi banodusughe o ndaghu dusosusu. Bamayene wende na nzangu mumbari, bamadjabe yiri Nzambi atsibalabe yi bawelimine ukwanu mu dine di Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Mba kale yilumbu, va dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi na mu ndaghu mowu, bamabwelaange ulonze na uwanze musamu wuboti wu Djesu Kirisete.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yisambwali yi batu bakesolu mu wamuse bilumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Mu temu eni, durangu du badukitsi dumafunaange. Kaboghu baSwife abamavosaange mbembu baNgereke, bakengugerene mu djowu abamavosaange mbembu baEberu. Mumbari bakwili ba baNgereke, bamafwimbungu mu bighudji abimaghabungu kale yilumbu. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Dighumi na babedji bakenengile yinombu yi badukitsi nobatsingule riye: «Dighadiwelimine yi tukedunde ulonze musamu wu Nzambi mughabaange bighudji. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Ladibandu, baane ba tadji, solanu yisambwali yi babaale bavu na bumbedji buboti, babase na Yinyuni Yisyeme na dyele. Tukebaveghe yisalu yeni yine. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Tumbe djetu, tuvyosaange temu mu dusambu nolonze musamu Nzambi.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Dibundu dyotsu dikesinge ditase dyeni. Bakesole Yityene, dibaale dibase na Yinyuni Yisyeme, divu na yitu yandi yotsu mu Nzambi. Bakemwésole Filipe, Porekore, Nikanore, Timone, Paremenase na Nikolase, mwise Atyose dji Siri, djandi awu amasinge Nzambi baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Bakebawakise ombu bilumbi, bakebasambilile nobasakighe makake. <verse eid="ACT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Mbembu Nzambi djimanyavaange. Durangu du badukitsi dumafunaange o Serusaleme, na pwele bavaghulitsi ba paghu bamavayilaange Djesu yitu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yityene akeghangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Na mangolu na yese yi Nzambi amamuveghe, Yityene amalasaange bilimbe novaghe bimaghe bineni va ghari mukute. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Mwa dikabu di batu, bakemutsundise. Djowu batu ba ndaghu dusambu adjimanengulu «Bavighe abamadjeghusu». Mu ndaweni, mumabe baSwife ba misyengi mi Sirene na Alesanderi. Dikabu dimosi baSwife ba binange bi Silisi na Asi. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Tumbe basamarungule ughaghene nandi, mumbari amavosaange na dyele di Yinyuni Yisyeme. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Kaboghu bakefute batu muyéfure bumbedji yi: «Tutsimughulu esyengi Moyise na Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Anane bamarulile batu botsu, bivunde bi mukute na milonzi mi mighaghe. Mba bakesutusu Yityene nomughange, bakemubeghe va wusu fundu dji banzonzi. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Bakebeghe bambedji ba ufure, abamavose yi: «Mutu éwuwu aghedundi ulenze ndaghu adjisyeme dji Nzambi, na mughaghe Moyise! <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Tutsimughulu evosi yi Djesu mwise Nasarete, opanze ndaghu Nzambi na osanze mutsanu awu Moyise amasile.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Batu botsu abamabe va ghari fundu dji banzonzi, bamalabe yinzi yi Yityene yimabaghunu nane ayi yanze.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yityene uvose evosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Mulonzi awuvu yivunde akemuwivule: «Adibevosi mu ndedju, dingenze?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Yityene akewaghule yiri: «Baane ba ngudji na batate nkululwanu, Nzambi bundumbe amalabene na kaaghe etu Aberaame, ave amabile o yinange yi Mesopotami ne akewende o musyengi Arane. <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>Nzambi akemutsingule yiri: “Sile bulongu bwaghu na yifumbe yaghu, na wende o bulongu abu nyuwulase<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Dib 12.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Na vane Aberaame akedjusughe bulongu bu Babilone na akewende oyétsane o musyengi Arane. Mba tadji Aberaame anofu, Nzambi akemubeghe o bulongu bughone abu dwitsanini na nyangu.<verse eid="ACT 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Nzambi asamamuveghe disyale, ne mwa mbure djusunzile ditambi o bulongu bweni. Tumbe, amamuveghe pangini djudile bulongu bwotsu, djandi na bakule bandi. Yotsu yine, Aberaame mbé asekabe na baane. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Nzambi amamutsingule rye: “Baane na bateghule baghu boyétsane o bulongu bu bweni, awu bobile bavighe na botsoghusulu mu kame-djine (400) tsi bilime. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Tumbe menu Nzambi, nyusosise mukute awu djowu bobile bavighe. Na vane, bopale o bulongu bu buvighe, na bondumise va mbure eni djidji<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Dib 15.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Ukm 3.12</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Nzambi amatunge pangini na Aberaame. Yilimbe yi pangini eni, urebe mwane. Mbana, Aberaame akerebe mwane andi Yisaake mu yilumbu yi munana. Yisake akerebe Sakobe wandi. Sakobe akerebe bandi baane, abavu dighumi na bifumbe bibedji bi bakaaghe betu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>Bakaaghe betu bamavine mwane tadji owu Sosefe na bakemusumbise. Sosefe akenebeghu o bulongu bu Yisipete. Tumbe Nzambi amabe nandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>Akemughobule mu ditsoghe. Akemuveghe dyele na yese va wusu Farawu, kaghe Yisipete omamusole murumitsi Yisipete na ndaghu andi djotsu.<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Dungosu du nzale dukerughe o bulongu bu Yisipete na bu Kanane. Batu bamatsoghe pwele, ladibandu batadji betu basamamwédile bighudji. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Sakobe anowulu yiri wudji bighudji o Yisipete, aketinde bane bandi wune, bakaaghe betu kumbu adji teghe. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Adjimubedji, Sosefe akekedjabise na baane ba ngudji bandi. Na yilombi yandi yikedjabunu na Kaghe Farawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Sosefe akenengile tadji andi Sakobe na yifumbe yandi yotsu. Djobotsu bamabe maghumi-dusambwali ma batu na batu baranu (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Sakobe akewende o Yisipete. Akefwile wune, na bakaaghe betu wandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Bakenebeghe bivisi bi bakaaghe bowu o musyengi Siseme noyétsighe o ngile adji Aberaame amasumbe na dufunu du mbongu na baane ba Emore tadji Siseme.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>Temu adji Nzambi amavangene na Aberaame djinobambene, mukute etu wumafune o Yisipete. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Mba kaghe djighone adjisamadjabe Sosefe, akebonge yitsighe yi bukaghe bu Yisipete. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Kaghe eni akedyonge bakaaghe betu, akebatsoyise o buvighe, tena amasile bane bowu ufu.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Va temu eni, Moyise akeburu, mwane wumabe tinde ubwedji va wusu Nzambi. Amabungulu mu miweli miryeru va kane tadji andi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Anopalusu na biburu byandi, mwane mughetu wu Kaghe Farawu akemubonge na akemubungule nane mwane andi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Moyise akebungulu na dyele di bise Yisipete, mbana akebe dibaale dighobusu mu posulu na bisalu byandi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>Anobe na maghumi-mana ma bilime (40), akeghane kake djuyélabe baane ba ngudji andi bandi, baYisrayele. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Anolabe yiri mwise Yisipete yike wandi etsoyisi, akemuwamuse notoyise mwise Yisipete nomuboke. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Amatase yiri baane ba ngudji bandi bowulu yiri Nzambi obaveghe dughobutsu mu djandi, tumbe basamadidjabe. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Moyise akebengune na batu babedji bamatoghaange. Anoronde ughabuse duvotsu va ghari owu, akebatsingule rye: “Bambatsi, dudji baane ba ngudji, dibandu yi dibokisini nane?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Omatsoyisaange mbatsi andi, akesindile Moyise novose: “Anyi atsyusole mube yivunde na nzonzi va ghari etu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Wirondi umboke menu wandi, nane wutsibokile mwise Yisipete masighe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Ukm 2.11-15</ref></char></note>?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Mu posulu tsyeni, Moyise akerine, aketsane o bulongu bu Madyane. Akebure bane babedji wune.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>Maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime manovyoghe, o kumu dukange beli na mukongu wu Sinayi, yanze yi Nzambi yikelabene nandi o ghari mulutsu diningi adimalulaange. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Moyise akesutu mune amalabile nane, tumbe ave amabambenine mu labe burange, akewulu dyufi di Fumu dimavosaange yi: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>“Menu nyidji Nzambi baghulu baghu, Nzambi Aberaame, Nzambi Yisaake na Nzambi Sakobe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ukm 3.6</ref></char></note>.” Noregheme, Moyise asamarungule ughengile. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Kaboghu Fumu akemuvaghe yi: “Vule bapondu baghu, mumba wudji va mbure djisyeme. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Nyimalabe nane batu bami bétsoghusulu o bulongu bu Yisipete. Nyimawulu mighamu myowu, nyirughe muyibaghobule. Tsyéwendi, nyiwutindi o Yisipete<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7-8">Ukm 3.7-8</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>Awuwu, Moyise, dibaale adi baane ba Yisrayele bamaghale novose yi: “Anyi atsyusole mube yivunde na nzonzi va ghari etu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Ukm 2.14</ref></char></note>?” Nzambi amamutinde nane yivunde na mughobutsi wu mukute andi, va yinzime yi yanze ayimalabene nandi mu diningi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Moyise omapalise baane ba Yisrayele o bulongu bu Yisipete, novaghe bimaghe na bilimbe bipwele o bulongu bweni, o Mubu Wubenge, teno dukange. Mambu motsu mane, mamadughusu mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>Moyise, dibaale adimatsingule mukute Yisrayele yi: “Va ghari mukute enu, Nzambi opalise mubiyitsi nane menu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Ave mughungi wu Yisrayele wumabile o dukange, Moyise djandi amabe va ghari baghulu betu na yanze, ayimavosaange nandi o mukongu wu Sinayi. Akedile musamu Nzambi awiveyi monyu, mu tudjabise woni.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Tumbe baghulu betu basamaronde umuwululu. Bakemuwengule na nzale ughabughe o Yisipete. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Baketsingule Arone: “Tuvayili banyambi aboyenewendaange va wusu etu, mumbari tughedjabi aditsiruyile Moyise, otsitupalise o Yisipete<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Ukm 32.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Baketule kosi mu yibaghunu yi mwane ngombi na bakevaghule paghu va wusu andi. Bakevaghe mumengu mu yime ayi djobeni bamatule. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Nzambi akebaliyili nzime, nobasile uyitse batsungi na bambwelili, nane disonunu mu mughande babiyitsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Mukute Yisrayele, tsiri ombu menu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">dumayivaghulili paghu tsyenu na bisaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu temu adjidumabile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime o dukange.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Nesi, dumabeghe disambe di nyambi enu Moloke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">na yibaghunu yi mbwelili nyambi enu Refane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Abine, bime abi dumatule mu biyitsaange.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ladibandu, nyudubeyile nane bise tsughu o vale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">uvyoghe bulongu bu Babilone<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5.25-27</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>Mu kumu dukange, baghulu betu bamabe na ndaghu yibengunu. Moyise amadjirunge nane Nzambi amamusindiyile bwé akedjivaghe, mu yibaghunu ayi amalabe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Baghulu betu bamadile ndaghu eni. Mu dirume di Sosye, bakedjibeghe o bulongu bu batu abe Nzambi amasanze va wusu owu. Djikebe vane tena temu kaghe Davide. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Djandi wughu akedile yese va wusu Nzambi. Akevonde musughe wurunge ndaghu djisyeme dji Nzambi Sakobe. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Tumbe mwane andi Salemu amamurungile djoni.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Yotsu yine Nzambi-Pungu, aghétsani mu mandaghu amarungu na makake ma batu. Mubiyitsi evosi yi:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>“Divose Fumu Nzambi rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Djulu yitsighe yi bukaghe bwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Butambe yisunzulu yi makulu mami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Munongu ndaghu yi durungule utungile?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Vo mbure yi djurungule ube yivumunu yami?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Byotsu bine, tsiri mebeni nyimabisunde na makake mami<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isa 66.1-2</ref></char></note>?”<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>Dune kande, mirime myenu mighale na matudji menu madibe va wusu mbile Nzambi! Dughededili Yinyuni Yisyeme! Dudji nane bakaaghe benu. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Mubiyitsi awu batadji benu basamakwane anyi? Bamaboke abamabighe durughulu du Mutu awusungeme. Mutu eni wune, dumamusumbise nomuboke. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Byanze bimaduveghe mughaghe Nzambi, tumbe dumabuse uwughobise!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yityene eboku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Ave bamawululu posulu tsyeni, fundu dji banzonzi djikenyoyile Yityene. Na kabu, bakevaghaange duweriti na minu mowu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Tumbe Yityene, abasilange na Yinyuni Yisyeme, akeghengile o djulu, akelabe kembu Nzambi na Djesu diteli va mabaale mandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Akevaghe yi: «Wulwanu, nyilabi djulu djidibughe na Mwane mutu diteli va mabaale ma Nzambi!»<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Kaboghu, bakebwaghe mughamu wuneni nodibighe matudji. Bakeyémuvike djowu botsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Bakemupalise o musyengi nomutinde mamani bakemuboke. Bambedji bamasile bidwaru byowu na mwa mwane dibaale, wumanengulungu Sole. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Ave bamamutindilaange mamani, Yityene akesambilaange yi: «Fumu Djesu, wake yinyuni yami!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Mba akekuteme noghamughe na mangolu mandi motsu: «Fumu, batandi dibi dyédidi!» Yikemani, akefu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Mba Sole amarondaange dufu du Yityene.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Sole ekwani Dibundu di Kirisete</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Mune yilumbu akevyosulile ukwane dibundu di Serusaleme. Badukitsi botsu, uvenguse bilumbi, bakepanzighe mu byari byotsu bi Sudé na Samari. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Batu abamaghobisaange Nzambi baketswighe Yityene na bakemulile tinde na munyongu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Sole, djandi, akevataange upanze dibundu. Amawendaange ndaghu na ndaghu, akeghangaange bango yitu, na baghetu na babaale, akebabwaghaange o tsughu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipe esamuni musamu wuboti o Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Bango yitu abamatsyamughe bamanangaange bulongu, noyenelonzaange musamu wuboti. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filipe akewende o musyengi Samari, akebasamunine Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Mighungi na mighungi va mosi mimawulu posulu tsi Filipe, mumba mimawulu nolabe bilimbe bi bimaghe abi amavaghaange. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Na mighamu mineni, binyuni bibive bipwele bimapalaange mu batu. Bibomfi bipwele na bitsondu bimabelusu. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Kaboghu nzangu djikebe djineni mu musyengi eni.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Mutu winengulu Simu amaba vane kale o musyengi eni, amavandaange. Mavande mandi mamasutusungu mughungi wotsu wu Samari. Amakelabange nderi adji muneni. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Mba botsu, ubongile o bangebi teno bivunde, bamamughobisaange pwele. Bamavosaange yi: «Mutu éwuwu mangolu ma Nzambi, amenengulu “Mboboghe”.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Bamamughobisaange pwele, mumba mbé amatsinge nobasutusu na mavande mandi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Tumbe banosinge musamu wuboti awu Filipe amasamunaange, mu dyambu di Bukaghe bu Nzambi na mu dine di Djesu Kirisete, baghetu na babaale bakebatusu. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Djabeni Simu akesinge Djesu na akebatusu. Mune amalabilaange bimaghe bineni na bilimbe abi Filipe amavaghaange, amasutu na asamamwékakenange nandi.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Bilumbi o Serusaleme bakewulu yi bise Samari bamadile musamu Nzambi na nzangu. Adine bamabatindile Pyere na San. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Banotole o Samari, bakesambilile mu djowu abamasinge Nzambi, mumbari bakedile Yinyuni Yisyeme. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Ne vane babatusulungu mu dine di Fumu Djesu, Yinyuni Yisyeme mbé yisekasundughe ne mu wumosi va ghari owu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Pyere na San bakebasakighe makake na bakedile Yinyuni Yisyeme.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Simu anolabe yi Yinyuni Yisyeme yiveghu ombu bango yitu ave bilumbi bebasakiyili makake akeronde ubaveghe badoli. <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>Amabavaghe yi: «Peyanu ngudu, yi abe nyusakighaange makake bakedilaange Yinyuni Yisyeme.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Tumbe Pyere akemuwaghule yi: «Badoli baghu babungini na ndebeni, mumba wutsitase bwé peghulu dji Nzambi djisumbu na mbongu! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Wughane dikabu vo musughe mu yisalu yéyiyi, mumba murime aghu wughaa wusungeme va wusu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Vughule ditase dyaghu dibive na lende Fumu, lake pa dyurungule uvaghu, akewutande mu ditase dyédine. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mumba nyilabi na ngenze, yi wudji wubase na mele mabive mba wune mutsanu wubi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Kaboghu Simu akevaghe Pyere na San yi: «Djenubeni lendanu Fumu, yiri motsu dutsivose makétuyile.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Yikebémani ughabuse bumbedji nosamune Musamu wu Fumu, bilumbi bibedji bakeghabughe o Serusaleme. Mu nzile bakeyenelonzaange Musamu Wuboti mu mimbu mapwele ma Samari.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipe ebatisi yidjeti yi Yityopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Yanze yi Fumu yikevaghe Filipe yiri: «Releme, wende o yari yibande, mu nzile adjirambuyili o Serusaleme teno musyengi Ghase. Nzile adjivu mududu, djighémwévyoghulu na batu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Filipe akereleme, akewende na maswasu. Mu nzile, akebengune na muvangu wu Yityopi, yidjeti yineni yimakelisaange yilundulu yi Kandase, kaghe mughetu dji Yityopi. Djandi amarughe o Serusaleme mu yiyitse Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>na yikewughabughe amaghabughaange o dimbu dyandi. Amabe atsane va djulu dikalu dyandi dimayenedutungu na kabele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dikalu dyandi dimayenedutungu na kabele: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lotu baghore adjibabeyi o divite; yiwendulu ayimadutungu na bibulu bineni va temu adji ghulu.</char></note>. Na vane, amarangaange yibuku yi musamu wu mubiyitsi Yisayi.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Yinyuni Yisyeme yiketsingule Filipe bwé: «Bambene na dikalu dyédine.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Filipe amabambene mbangu-mbangu na akewulu yidjeti yi Yityopi, yimarangaange dibuku di mubiyitsi Yisayi na dyufi dineni. <figure style="fig" alt="Filipe ebatisi yidjeti yi Yityopi" file="WA03956b.tif" size="col" loc="8.26-40" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="8.30"/>Akemuwivule yi: «Wighulu na bureti amewirangi?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Yidjeti yeni akemuwaghule yiri: «Tsyeni nyurungulile uwulu, ta vagha mutu wupindiyile?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:31">Vane-vane, amavaghe Filipe akenangeme notsane va mughule andi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Yibuku yi Bisonu ayi amarangaange ayiyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Amaba nane yindombu ayi bébeyi o uboke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nane mwane yindombu awibi dibabe va wusu mufuyitsi, asamadibule munu andi.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Amalenzu mba musughe andi wumadesu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Kule andi, anyi odjirangemine?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Mumba batsimutabule monyu va butambe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isa 53.7-8</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Yidjeti akewivule Filipe yi: «Kokolu, nzinguli anyi mubiyitsi eranguni nane, djabeni ekevosile vo mutu susu?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filipe akemuwaghule, akemutsingule musamu wuboti wu Djesu, ubandile vane dibandu di Yibuku yeni yi Bisonu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Bakebwele wuwende na baketole va mbure djimabe mambe. Yidjeti akevaghe yi: «Labati mudjambe! Kaboghu wurungule umbatise, mbeyé?» [<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filipe akemuvaghe yi: «Payi wune tinde yitu, wurungule ubatusu.» Yidjeti akewaghule yi: «Yine, nine yitu mu Djesu Kirisete, Mwane Nzambi.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Yidjeti akesikighe dikalu, bakesundughe djone Filipe mu mudjambe. Na Filipe akemubatise. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Banosabughe, Yinyuni yi Fumu yiketsyemuse Filipe. Yidjeti asamamwémulabe, tumbe akeduke nzile andi na nzangu. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filipe akepalile o dimbu di Asote, mba akevyoghe misyengi na misyengi, noyenesamunaange Musamu Wuboti mbure tsyotsu tena ave amatole o yisyeni yi Sesaré.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Fumu Djesu enengili Sole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Mu temu eni, Sole amakwanaange pwele na amaghanaange uboke badukitsi ba Fumu. Amayérasene yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>nomuvonde mighande mi musughe wuwendile o mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife mu musyengi Damase. Na payi atsirasene babaale vo baghetu abeduki nzile Djesu, obaghange nobabeghe o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Abilaange mu nzile Damase, akebambene beli na musyengi. Sundile, yidjalale yinene ayi masundughe o djulu yikemuvedemine. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Akeyideme vatsi, na akewulu dyufi dimavosile rye: «Sole, Sole, dibandu yi winkwanini?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Akewivule: «Nde la nyi, Fumu?» Na dyufi dimamuwawule rye: «Menu la Djesu, awu wikwani. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Tumbe releme, kote o musyengi, aghune bowutsingule adiwudusu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Bambatsi ba mulingu ba Sole bamasikeme, bamaghambu na dyambu dyuvose. Bamawulu dyufi, tumbe basamalabe mutu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sole amareleme na amadibule misu, tumbe asamamwélabaange ne yime. Bamamughange mu dikake mu mubeghe o Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Mu bilumbu biryeru, asamarungule ulabe na amatsane nane, vagha wudji nonu.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Wumabe o Damase mudukitsi wumosi dine dyandi Nanyase. Fumu amalabene nandi mu yiryaryamu na akemunengile: «Nanyase!» Akewaghule: «Me djanduwu, Fumu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Fumu akemutsingule rye: «Lenge nowende mu nzile adjinengulu “Nzile Djisungeme”, o ndaghu Sudase. Aghune, wuyéwivule dibaale, mwise Tarese oyinengulu Sole. Usambile esambili. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Mu yiryaryamu, atsilabe dibaale dinengulu Nanyase, atsikotaange nomusakighe makake mumba akebwélabe.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Nanyase amawaghule rye: «Fumu, batu bapwele bamaposile mu dibaale dyeni na nyidjabi dibi adi amavaghe mu bango yitu o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Na atsirughe wunu na musughe awu amasingusulu na bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, muyighange botsu abeyitsi dine dyaghu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Tumbe Fumu aketsingule Nanyase: «Wende, mumbari nyimasole dibaale dyédine, mube musalitsi ami. Na djandi odjabise dine dyami mu malongu masusu, na bakaghe bowu, na mu mukute Yisrayele. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Nyumulase mebeni maghughe motsu ame olabe mu dyambu dyami.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Yike Nanyase amawende. Akekote o ghari ndaghu, akemusakighe makake, na akemutsingule rye: «Sole, mwane tadji ami, Fumu Djesu otsilabene naghu mu nzile ave wutsiruyilaange, atsinzindighe ombu aghu. Motsu mane, mumba wukebwélabe na wukebasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Vane-vane, bime bibaghunu na maghaghele bimabondughe mu misu ma Sole na amamwélabe. Amareleme na amabatusu. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Anodji, mangolu mandi, mamamughabuyile.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sole esamuni Musamu Wuboti o Damase</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sole amatsane mwa bilumbu na badukitsi abamabe o Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Vane-vane, Sole amabande ulonze mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife, yiri Djesu adji mwane Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Botsu abamamuwulungu bamakambulu na bamawivulaange: «Tsi djandi otsikwanaange o Serusaleme botsu abamarangunaange dine di Djesu? Na agharughe wunu mu yibaghange nobabeghe va wusu bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Sole mu posulu tsyandi, amakewarisaange kale yilumbu. Tumbe baSwife ba Damase basamamwébe na dyukale mumbari djandi amabalasaange na kengili yiri Djesu la Kirisete.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Mwa pesu temu, baSwife bamaghane kake muboke Sole, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>tumbe amalubusu mu fundu owu. Makotulu motsu ma musyengi mamakelusungu nyangu na mukolu, mu mubokise. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Kaboghu badukitsi ba Sole bamamubeghe mukolu mu muvyose disimu dimosi di yivaghe yi musyengi, na bamamusunduse mu ponzi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sole o Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Ave Sole amatolile o Serusaleme, djandi mbé aronde ufubene mu dighuki di badukitsi. Tumbe djobotsu bamabe na ghome andi, mumbari vasamabe ne wumosi wumatasaange yiri ngenze Sole amakalughe mudukitsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Adine Barenabase amamubongile nandi, akemubeghe ombu bilumbi. Barenabase akebwébatsingule nane mu nzile, Sole amalabinine na Fumu, na nane Fumu amavosile nandi. Barenabase amabwese ubatsingule nane Sole o musyengi Damase, amasamunine na musighe mu dine di Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Yike Sole amayenewendaange noghabughe nowu o Serusaleme, na amasamunaange na musighe mu dine di Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Djandi amavosaange notsunde na baSwife abamavosaange mbembu baNgereke, tumbe djowu bamarondaange umubokise. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Baane ba tadji bandi banodidjabe, bamabeghe Sole o yisyeni yi Sesaré, na bakemuwendise o yisyeni yi Tarese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Dibundu mu musyengi wotsu wu Sudé, wu Ngalile na wu Samari, dimabe mu duvotsu. Dimaneghaange mu yitu, dimabéghaange monyu mu dighobe di Fumu na dimafunaange na dwamusu du Yinyuni Yisyeme.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere ebelusi Ené</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Pyere wandi, amayenevyoyilangaange mbure tsyotsu, akesundughe ombu bango yitu abamatsanaange o musyengi Lide. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Aghune, akerasene dibaale dinengulu Ené dimabe disileme va ditoghu mu yinane yi bilime, mumbari amabe yimbolutu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Yike Pyere akemutsingule: «Ené, Djesu Kirisete eghubelusi! Releme, kunze ditoghu dyaghu.» Sundile Ené akereleme. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Ave bamamulabile, batu botsu bamatsanaange o musyengi Lide na kumu Sarone, bamasinge Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere eghabusi Tabite monyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Wumabe o musyengi Sopé, mudukitsi mughetu wumanengulu Tabite, vo «Dorkase» o mbembu Ngereke, diwendili bwé «Tsyesi». Amavyosaange temu andi novaghaange bisalu biboti nowamuse bidjaghe. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Mu temu eni, amadimbene ubele na akefu. Dunyuru dunobwitsu, dumasunzu o yibuku yi ndaghu ayi djulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Badukitsi abamabe o musyengi Sopé, badjabilaange yiri Pyere amabe o musyengi Lide, awuvu bébeli na Sopé, Bakemutindile babaale babedji muyémulende: «Wuyabwétsinge, lenge norughe ombu ghetu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Pyere amawende nowu. Anotole, bamamubeghe o yibuku yi ndaghu ayi djulu. Bakwili botsu bamabambene nandi nolile. Bamamulase bikutu na bilinge, abi Dorkase amavaghaange ave amabilaange monyu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Pyere akepalise batu botsu, akekuteme na akesambile. Mba amaghelughe o yari yi mvumbi novose rye: «Tabite, releme!» Lake Tabite akedibule misu, anolabe Pyere, akesimbughe na aketsane. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Pyere amamuveghe dikake na akemuwamuse ureleme. Amanengile bango yitu na bakwili, na amabalase Tabite monyu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Dimadjabunu mu musyengi wotsu wu Sopé na bapwele bamavayile Fumu yitu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>O musyengi eni, Pyere amatsane yitsingu yineni ombu Ngele-Bibande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngele-Bibande: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">djandi awu ekunzi bapondu, bakomi, biswelu bi mbongu, na mikate mi bibulu vo mi banyoghe. </char></note>, djinengulu Simu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yanze evosili Korneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>O Sesaré wumabe dibaale dimanengulungu Korneye. Amabe yivunde yi kame baghore mu dibuli adimanengulungu «Mughungi baghore ba Yitali.» <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Amabe na dinonge na amadumaange Nzambi na kane andi djotsu. Amawamusaange bidjaghe bi baSwife na amasambilaange Nzambi temu tsyotsu.<verse eid="ACT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Mwa yilumbu, va murekemunu wisi va tsisighe, beli na maweru maryeru, amadile yiryaryamu. Na tsiyiri akelabe yanze yi Nzambi ukote ombu wandi na akemunengile yi: «Korneye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Akeghengile na dunzyenzi na akewaghule rye: «Fumu, dyambu yi?» Yanze nomuwaghule yi: «Nzambi atsironde tsambu tsyaghu na dwamusu adu wiveyi bidjaghe, na eghurangemini. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Tumbe, sindighe batu o musyengi Sopé, bakénengile Simu awu bénengili Pyere. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Etsani ombu Simu Ngele-Bibande, ndaghu andi djidji va mughule mubu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Yike yanze ayimavose nandi yiwendi, Korneye akenengile basatsi bandi babedji na ghore mosi djimamusalilaange, adjimabe mutu wunonge na Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Akebatsingule motsu amamavyoghe mba akebatinde o Sopé.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiryaryamu yi Pyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, yotsu yine mbé baki mu nzile ave bamabambeninaange na musyengi Sopé, Pyere akemate o djulu ndaghu mu yésambile, va diweru di mwangulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Akewulu nzale, mbé aronde udji. Temu adji bamamulambilaange bighudji, akelabe yiryaryamu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Amalabe djulu djimadibughe, na yime yimasundughaange. Yime yeni yimabe nane yibuku yi tsande djineni, djighangu mu kodu tsyotsu tsi djine, adjimasundughe tena vatsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Mu tsande eni, mumabe minongu myotsu mi bibulu abivu na biname bina, minongu myotsu mi bilandile bi butambe, na minongu myotsu mi batsoli. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Akewulu dyufi dimamuvosile yiri: «Pyere, releme! Boke bibulu byébibi na djange!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Tumbe Pyere akewake: «Tsatsabi! Fumu ami, nyisekadjangaange abivu yingitsi vo binzoruru.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Dyufi dikemwéghulunu nandi adi mubedji, na dikevose yiri: «Abi Nzambi amalyomise, ndedju wuyabilabe nzoruru.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Dyoni dimalabene kumbu yiryeru, mba yime yeni yikematusu o djulu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Pyere amakewivulaange divindughulu di yiryaryamu ayi abenolabe. Vane-vane, batu abe Korneye amatinde, banomane uwivule mu djabe ave ndaghu Simu Ngele-Bibande djivu, baketole va dikotulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Bamadukise na bamawivule rye: «Avave Simu adjinengulu Pyere etsanini?» <verse eid="ACT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Pyere wukelule mbé akikelule yiryaryamu yandi, ave Yinyuni yimamutsingulile yiri: «Wulu, vadji batu baryeru béwurombi. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Releme, vindeme na wende nowu, wuyatsikedene, mumba menu nyibasindiyi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Pyere akevindeme ombu batu beni nobatsingule yi: «Nyidjandughu, menu dirombi. Dibandu yi dutsiruyile?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Bakewaghule yi: «Tutsitindu na Korneye, yivunde yi baghore. Dibaale disungeme, didumi Nzambi, na baSwife botsu bémurondi. Yanze yi Nzambi yimayimuveghe dilongi dyédidi: “Nengile Pyere o ndaghu aghu na wulu motsu ame owutsingule.”» <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Pyere akebakotise o ghari ndaghu na akebaveghe bitsighe byuvyosile mukolu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Pyere ewendi ombu Korneye</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Va kedi dji yilumbu ayimadukaange, Pyere amasimbughe na amawende nowu. Baane ba tadji bamosi ba Sopé bamawende nandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Djowu bamatole o musyengi Sesaré mu yilumbu ayi mubedji. Korneye amabavivaange na biburu byandi na bambatsi bandi ba murime, abe amanengile. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Ave Pyere amatolile, Korneye akémubengusunu, amakébwaghe va makulu mandi mu muyitse. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Tumbe Pyere akemurelighe nomutsingule yi: «Releme! Mumbari menu nyidji mutu nane ndedju.»<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Va djulu vane, amayenevosaange na Korneye. Anokote o ghari ndaghu, amarasunu batu bapwele baghukeme. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Akebatsingule rye: «Dwidjabi yi muSwife aghane musughe wube mbatsi mweni, vo mu ukote o ndaghu andi. Tumbe Nzambi atsindonze yi, vagha mutu awu menu nyurungule wulabe yiri adji nzoruru vo agha awelimine ufwamu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Ladibandu, ave dutsitindile batu o wuyindengile, ngalabe diweru mu urughe. Kaboghu, nyirondi udjabe adi dutsindengilile.»<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Korneye akewaghule yiri: «Vake bilumbu bina, va temu dji maweru maryeru ma tsisighe, nyimasambilaange. Suka, mutu na bikutu bikademi akepale va wusu ami. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Akenzingule: “Korneye, dusambu dwaghu dumadughusu, na Nzambi atsirangemine dwamusu du maboti amewivayili bidjaghe. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Kaboghu sindighe mutu o Sopé mu uyenengile Simu awu bénengili Pyere. Etsani ombu Simu mosi, Ngele-Bibande adjitsani va mughule mubu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Nzilenge notinde batu mu yiwulande na wutsisinge urughe. Vave, tudji djetu botsu va wusu Nzambi, mughulu motsu ame Fumu atsiwurume mu yitutsingule.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyere elonzi Musamu Wuboti ombu Korneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Anane Pyere amabongile mbembu novose yiri: «Mba nyimawulu bwé Nzambi aghane dupasu du batu. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Mu malongu motsu, mutu awidumi Nzambi na avu asungeme, awune awelimine usingu nandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Amatindile bise Yisrayele mbembu andi, mu yitusamune Musamu Wuboti wu duvotsu adutumadile mu Djesu Kirisete, odjivu Fumu batu botsu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Dwidjabi adimarele uvyoghe o Ngalile, mba dikebwélabene mu Sudé djotsu. Motsu mane mamavyoyile, yike San emani usamune musamu wu dubatusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Dwidjabi nane Nzambi amasolile Djesu mwise Nasarete, nomuveghe mangolu ma Yinyuni Yisyeme. Dwidjabi wandi nane Djesu amanangile bulongu, noyenevaghaange diboti noghobulaange botsu abamabe baghangu na dyabu, mumba Nzambi amabe nandi.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Mba djetu, tudji bambedji ba motsu ame amavaghe o bulongu bu baSwife, teno Serusaleme. Djandi awu bamabokise, nomulelighe va kurusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Tumbe Nzambi, amamurambuse o dufu yilumbu ayimuryeru, na amavaghe yi akelabene. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Asamalabene na mikute myotsu, tumbe yike na djetu abe Nzambi amasole vane dibandu mube bambedji. Anorambughe, tumadji nonu nandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Amaturume ulonze Musamu Wuboti, ombu mukute na utsiyise yi, adji mutu awu Nzambi amabyatse, mu ufundise abavu monyu na abafu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Babiyitsi botsu bamavose mu djandi, botsu abemuvayili yitu, bodile dutandu du mabi dibandu djandi.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Pyere uvose mbé akivose, Yinyuni Yisyeme yikesundughe mu botsu abamawulungu musamu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Bango yitu abamabe barebu, abamarughe na Pyere, bakekambulu mu ulabe yi, peghulu Yinyuni Yisyeme djimaghabulu djowu botsu abasamabe baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Ngenze, bango yitu abarebu, bamabawulungu uvose mu mambembu masusu noyitse Nzambi. Kaboghu Pyere akevose yi: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Tughorungule ughandise batu bébabe dubatusu du mambe, badililaange Yinyuni Yisyeme nane djetu!» <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Na akeveghe musughe ubabatise mu dine di Djesu Kirisete. Kaboghu bakemuwivule aketsane mwa bilumbu nowu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Pyere ekekaghule va wusu dibundu di Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Bilumbi na baane ba tadji abamabe o yinange yi Sudé, bakewulu bwendiri bise malongu wandi bamadile musamu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Ave Pyere amamatile o Serusaleme, bango yitu abarebu bamamutsundise <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>novose rye: «Ndedju wutsikote ombu batu abagha batabulu, na wutsidji va mosi nowu!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Yike Pyere akebatsingule na musighe, mambu motsu, ubongile o dibandu teno disukusulu, akebatsingule rye: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Menu, nyimabe o musyengi Sopé na nyimasambililaange, nganingelene na ngadile yiryaryamu. Lake ngalabe yime nane yibuku yi tsande djineni, djighangu mu kodu tsyotsu tsi djine, djimasundughaange o djulu na djikerughe tena va wusu ami. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Nyimadjitsune na burange na nyimalabe bibulu abivu na biname bina, minongu myotsu mi bibulu bi musiru, minongu myotsu mi bilandile bi butambe na batsoli. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Mba nyimawulu dyufi dimapaghe yi: “Pyere, releme! Boke bibulu byébibi na djange!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Tumbe nyimawaghule yi: “Tsatsabi! Fumu ami, mumbari nyiburulu, nyisekadjangaange bibabi vo abivu yingitsi. Mumba byoni, bighorungule ukote o munu ami.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Mu dyoni, mbembu eni djimawulunu o djulu, djimabwéposile adi mubedji yi: “Abi Nzambi amalyomise, ndedju wuyabilabe nzoruru.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Dyoni dimalabene kumbu yiryeru, mba byotsu bikeghabughe o djulu.»<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Pyere akebwese uvose: «Vane-vane, babaale baryeru bamarughesene o musyengi Sesaré mu yimbonge, bamatole va wusu ndaghu adjitumabe. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Yike, Yinyuni yimanzingule bwé wende nowu, wuyabe némwapesu na keri. Na baane ba tadji ba syamunu ababe, bamayinkelise, na tumakote djetu botsu ombu dibaale dyédidi. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Djandi amatutsingule nane amalabile yanze o ghari ndaghu andi, ayi yimabe vane, na yimamutsingule yiri: “Sindighe mutu o musyengi Sopé, akéwunengilile Simu awu bénengili Pyere. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Djandi oyiwutsingule musamu, awu ndedju na ndaghu aghu djotsu, dughobululu.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Ave nyimabandile uvose, Yinyuni Yisyeme yikesundughe mu djowu botsu, nane yimasunduyile mu djetu va dibandu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Yike nyimarangemine mbembu Fumu adjimavosaange yi: “San amabatise mu mambe, tumbe djenu, dubatusu mu Yinyuni Yisyeme.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Nzambi amabaveghe yisaku yine yimosi, nane amatuveyile djetu wandi, ave tumasunzile yitu yetu mu Fumu Djesu Kirisete. Tumbe anyi menu mbé nyimabe, murungule ughaghene na Nzambi?»<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Banowulu yilombi yeni, bango yitu abamabe barebu, bakevole «swii», bakesigheme. Djowu botsu bakeyitse Nzambi novose rye: «Kaboghu dingenze, Nzambi amaveghe bise malongu wandi abagha barebu, yese yukalughe mutsanu wubive, mu dile monyu mutubu na mutubu.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibundu di Antyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Yityene anoboku, bango yitu bamapanzighe dibandu dikwane, adimaduke dufu dwandi. Na djobotsu bamawende yari na yari: abane o yinange Fenisi, bamosi o ningi dji Sipere na o musyengi Antyose. Tumbe bamayenesamunaange musamu Nzambi, yike ombu djowu abamabe baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Yike va ghari owu, vamabe bise Sipere na Sirene, djowu bakerughe o musyengi Antyose. Bamayenesamunaange Musamu Wuboti wu Fumu Djesu ombu djowu abamavosaange mbembu baNgereke. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Mangolu ma Fumu mamabe nowu, adine bapwele bamasinge Fumu Djesu na bamakalughe mutsanu owu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Bivunde bi dibundu di Serusaleme banowulu yilumbi yeni, baketinde Barenabase o musyengi Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Anotole wune, ave amalabile motsu ame yese yi Nzambi yimadughusu, amabase na nzangu djineni. Na vane, amawarise bango yitu botsu bakesunze yitu yowu mu Fumu, na bakébwéghabughe manzinzime. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barenabase amabangaange dibaale adisungeme, dibase na Yinyuni Yisyeme, divu na yitu yandi yotsu mu Nzambi. Yinombu yineni yimasinge Fumu Djesu mu monyu owu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Mba Barenabase amawende o musyengi Tarese oyérombe Sole. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Ave amamulabile, akemubeghe o musyengi Antyose. Djobotsu bakevyose yilime yifwimbe o dibundu, nolonzaange batu bapwele yitu mu Nzambi. Aghune dibundu di Antyose, badukitsi bamanengululu aditeghe: «Bakereti».<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Mune temu eni, babiyitsi bamadusughe musyengi Serusaleme mu wende o musyengi Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Mubiyitsi wumosi wumanengulu Aghabise, abasu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, amabighe bwé nzale djineni djube mu butambe bwotsu. Yike nzale eni djimalabene va temu adji Kolode amabile kaghe. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Badukitsi bamakape disite, bwé kale mutu mbé oveghaange nane odilile na mangolu mandi, mu wamuse baane ba tadji abamatsanaange o yinange yi Sudé. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Anane bamavayile. Baketinde Barenabase djone Sole bakebeghe dwamusu dweni, ombu bivunde bi dibundu di Sudé.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Sake eboku, Pyere eghangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Va temu eni, kaghe Yirode akeghangise mwa dikabu di batu ba dibundu mu bakwane. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Na didjenge akebokise Sake, mwane ngudji San. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Anolabe yi baSwife bamadironde, akeghangise Pyere va temu mumengu wu bapembi abagha dufunusu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Yirode akemughaange nomusunze o tsughu. Akesindighe binombu bine bi baghore mu mukelisaange. Kadi yinombu yimabe ghore djine. Amabe na ditase dyumufundise, va ghari batu yike mumengu Pake wivyoyi. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Pyere abilange o tsughu, bise dibundu bamasambile Nzambi na yikanene mu djandi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yanze yipalisi Pyere o tsughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Yirode amabe na ditase dyumubeghe va wusu banzonzi. Tumbe mune mukolu, Pyere amabe atungu pange bedji, na amabe yilu va ghari ghore bedji. Baghore bamosi, bamamoghaange va wusu mune ndaghu tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Sundile, yanze yi Fumu yikekote mba tsughu djotsu djikekademe na yidjalale. Yanze yikekungise Pyere nomudimbe mbate o maghetu, mba akemutsingule yi: «Lenge noreleme!» Na bapange baketudughe mu makake mandi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Yanze yike muvaghe yiri: «Tunge beleti aghu na dware bapondu baghu.» Akedivaghe. Yanze yikemwémuvaghe yi: «Dware yikutu yaghu na nduki.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Pyere akeduke yanze na akepale o tsughu. Asamadjabaange yiri adi yanze amavaghaange dingenze, amatasaange yiri yiryaryamu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Bakevyoghe yinombu yi baghore ayiteghe, bakevyoghe ayi mubedji, baketole va yabutsu yi madilu ayi mune ndaghu awumusitu. Yabutsu yeni yikedibughe pinze va wusu owu na bakepale. Banosupughe mu nzile, yanze yikekakene nandi. <verse eid="ACT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Kaboghu Pyere akewulu adimavyoghaange, na akekévosile yi: «Mba nyimadjabe yi dingenze: Fumu atsitinde yanze yandi, na djandi, atsinkaghule va makake ma Yirode, na ame bivunde bi baSwife mbé baronde undase.»<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Ave amadiwululu nane, akewende o ndaghu Mari, ngudji San adjinengulu Mareke. Aghune, batu bapwele bamabe baghukeme na bamasambililaange. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Ave Pyere amakokemunine mu yabutsu yi mune ndaghu, musatsi mughetu, awinengulu Rode, akebambene mughulu. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Akedjabe dyufi di Pyere, tumbe na kini asamadibule, aketsingule abamabe o ghari yi Pyere adji va dulombili. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Bakemuvaghe yi: «Wune bulaghu!» Tumbe amatsiyisaange yi ngenze. Kaboghu bakevaghe yi: «Awune tangudji yanze yandi.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Yotsu yina, Pyere ukokemune mbé akikokemune. Bakemudibulile yabutsu, na bakesutu ave bamamulabile. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Akesambe dikake mubavotse, akebatsingule nane Fumu amamupalisile o tsughu, mba akebasindighe yiri: «Wendanu yétsingulanu Sake na baane ba tadji basusu.» Anomane, akepale nowende yari yisusu.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Wisi anotebughe, vakebe nkumfu neni va ghari baghore. Djowu bamakewivulaange: «Pyere akewuke?» <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Yirode akeveghe dirume dyumurombe, tumbe basamamulabe. Akewave baghore, na akeveghe musughe wu baboke. Va djulu vane, akeghusughe o yinange yi Sudé novindeme o musyengi Sesaré mu yévume mwa temu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dufu du kaghe Yirode Agheripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Yirode amabe na kabu neni na bise Tire na bise Sidone. Djowu bakewulusunu va mosi mu sumbe yivunde, ayimakelisaange bime byotsu bi kaghe, dine dyandi Balesetose. Bamavayile nane, mumbari bamarondaange uvonde duvotsu na kaghe Yirode, dibilaange yiri bighudji byowu byotsu, bimarughesenaange o bulongu bwandi. <verse eid="ACT 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Mu yilumbu ayi bamasikighe, Yirode akedware yidjunge yi bukaghe, aketsane va yitsighe yandi yi bufumu, mba akebavosilaange. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Yike yinombu yimaghamughe yiri: «Djandi evosi nane nyambi, tsiri nane mutu!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Tumbe vane-vane, yanze yi Fumu yikemudimbe, mumba amabonge bundumbe bu Nzambi: akelighu na misobe, na akefu.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Musamu wu Nzambi wumanyavaange laviri. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barenabase na Sole yikebemani yisalu yowu o musyengi Serusaleme, bakeyeneghabughe, na bamabeghe nowu San awu amanengulungu Mareke.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yinyuni Yisyeme yisoli Barenabase na Sole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Mu dibundu ayimabe o musyengi Antyose, vamabe babiyitsi na milonzi: Barenabase, Simewu adjinengulu «Munombi», Lususe mwise Sirene, Manayene omabungughe va mosi na kaghe Yirode, na Sole. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Mwa yilumbu ayi bamayitsilaange Fumu nowarile nzale, Yinyuni Yisyeme akebavaghe yiri: «Vengighanu Barenabase na Sole va mughule, bakedughusungu yisalu ayi nyimabanengilile.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Kaboghu, banomane uwarile nzale nosambile, bakebasakighe makake na bakebasile uyenewende.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barenabase djone Sole béwendi o musyengi Sipere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Banotindu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, Barenabase na Sole bakevindeme o disabu di Selesi. Avane, bamanangemine mu watange muwende o ningi dji Sipere. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Ave bamatolile o Salemine, bamasamune musamu Nzambi mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife. San adjinengulu Mareke amabe nowu nane mukange.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Limase adji mulosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Vane wusu, banosabughe ningi djotsu bamatole o musyengi Pafose, bamayerasene muSwife, dibaale dimavagha bulosi. Dibaale dyeni dimabe mubiyitsi wumfurulu, dimanengulu «Bare-Djesu». <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Djandi, amabe yisatsi yi yidjeti yineni ayimarumisaange yinange, yi manenguluungu Sersyo Poluse, dibaale dimabe na dudjabu. Djandi akenengile Barenabase na Sole, mumbari amabe na nzale uwulu musamu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Tumbe mulosi eni, awu bamanengilaange o mbembu Ngereke «Limase», amabalase maghughe. Adine djandi amabaghubitsilaange yi yidjeti akéwulu musamu Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Kaboghu Sole omanengulungu «Pole» wandi, amabe abase na Yinyuni Yisyeme. Djandi akemughengile yiswisu mu misu, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>mba akemutsingule rye: «Ndedju awubase na mele na bikumbu, mwane dyabu, mumbini! Ngenze, ndedju wusekamane urekighe manzile ma Fumu amasungeme? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Avave, dikake di Fumu dike mu ndedju, wube yidunge. Mu mwa pesu temu, wughobwélabe dyénini di nyangu.» Sundila, misu ma Limase mamatsime, na piseme djimamughumbe, lake akeyenetsukemaange yari na yari, norombe mutu wumulonge nzile. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Ave yidjeti yeni amalabile dyambu adibenovyoghe va wusu andi, djandi amavayile Djesu yitu. Vane-vane, ndonzulu musamu Fumu djimabembe murime andi.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwanzu wu Pole o Antyose dji Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Pole na bambatsi bandi bamadusughe Pafose mu bwatu, muwendesene o disabu di Perse mu yinange yi Pafili. Aghune, San Mareke akebasile na akeghabughe o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Banodusughe musyengi Perse, Pole na bambatsi bandi bamatole o musyengi Antyose dji yinange yi Pisidi. Mu yilumbu yuvume, bakekote o ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife na baketsane. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Banomane urange mughaghe Moyise na babiyitsi, bivunde bi ndaghu dusambu bakesindighe mutu muyebawivule rye: «Baane ba ngudji, payi dune mwa musamu mu warise batu, tsyévosyanu!»<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Pole akereleme, akenangule dikake mubaghebule mba akevose yi: «Bise Yisrayele na djenu abedwidumi Nzambi, nkulwanu! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Nzambi baane ba Yisrayele, amasole baghulu betu. Amaroyise mukute eni, ave wumabilaange o bulongu bu Yisipete. Mba akewupalise na mangolu mandi o bulongu bweni. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Mba Nzambi amabasinge na bingulu byowu mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime, ave bamenewendilaange mu kumu dukange. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Va djulu vane, amadyamise yisambwali yi mikute o bulongu bu Kanane, na amaveghe mukute Yisrayele bulongu bweni nane disyale. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Motsu mane mamatsinge tangudji kame-djina na maghumi-maranu (450) ma bilime.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Va djulu vane, amaveghe bakaaghe betu banzonzi tena va temu mubyitsi Samwele. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Kaboghu, bakaaghe betu bamavonde kaghe djubabeyise. Nzambi akebaveghe Sawule, mwane Kise, mu yifumbe yi Binzame. Djandi amarumise mukute Yisrayele mu maghumi-mana (40) ma bilime. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Nzambi anodjusule Sawule va yitsighe yi bukaghe, amabaveghe Davide nane kaghe owu va yivinze yi Sawule. Nzambi amamughabusile bumbedji novose rye: “Menu nyimadile Davide, mwane Djese, dibaale diwelimine, adimpeyi nzangu o murime ami, odughusu mambu motsu ame nyirondi akedughusu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">Sa1 8.5</ref>,<ref loc="1SA 8:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10.21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:14">13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:21">Nim 89.21</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Yike mu mukute Davide, Nzambi amasole muteghule andi wumosi, Djesu mube Mughobutsi wu baane ba Yisrayele, nane amabaveyile pangini. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Ne Djesu akerughe, San-Batise amalonze mukute wotsu wu Yisrayele bwendiri: mbé boléfungule mabi mowu, nobatusu mu lase yiri bamakalughe myonu. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Ave yisalu yi San yimabile bebeli nosuke, djandi amabawivule rye: “Anyi dwitasi yiri nyivu? Menu, nga djandi awu dwikelisi. Tumbe wulwanu! Djandi oyiruyi, djabanu yiri: menu nga nyiwelmine, nesi yike mu munyangule mikudu mi bapondu bandi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">San 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mrk 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">San 1.27</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«Bane ba tadji, djenu abe duvu baane ba Aberaame, na djenu wandi, adwiruyi mu mikute misusu mba dwidumi Nzambi, musamu éwuwu wu dughobutsu wutsitutindulu djetu botsu anu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Batu abamatsanaange o Serusaleme na bivunde byowu bamaghale Djesu, na djowu basamatsiyise malongi ma babiyitsi amamarangu mu kale yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife. Tumbe ave bamafundisile Djesu, bamadughusu motsu ame babiyitsi bamabighaange. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Ne nane basamabe na tonu djumubokile, djowu bamavaghe Pilate yiri akeveghe musughe wumuboke. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Ave bamamanine udughusu mambu motsu ame Bisonu bi Nzambi bimavosaange mu djandi, bamasunduse yibindi yandi va kurusu na bakemusunze o ngile. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Tumbe Nzambi amamurambuse o dufu. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Mu bilumbu bipwele, Djesu amalabene ombu djowu abamayenewendaange nandi ubandile o Ngalile teno Serusaleme. Avave, djowu bakevu bambedji ba Djesu va wusu baane ba Yisrayele. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Na djetu, twidudjabisi Musamu Wuboti, pangini adji Nzambi amavangene na baghulu betu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Djandi amadjidughusu ombu djetu abe tuvu bateghule bowu, ave amarambusile Djesu o dufu. Nane direndulu mu mughande Nimbu awu mubedji yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“Ndedju wudji mwane ami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">na muni, nyimawubure<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Nim 2.7</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Nzambi amarambuse Djesu va ghari djowu abafu, mumba dunyuru dwandi dukeyébole o ghari mbine. Djandi amavose rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“Nyuduveghe myule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">ami nyimavangene na Davide,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">amisyeme na mi ngenze<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55.3</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Ladibandu, mbembu Nzambi djivosili mu kapu mosi yiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“Ndedju wughosile Yibyatsi yaghu Yisyeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">yikebole o ghari mbine<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Nim 16.10</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Yike Davide, anomane udughusu mu temu andi bisalu byotsu abi Nzambi amaronde bwé akedughusu, djandi amafu. Aketswighu mbure mosi adji bamatswiyile batadji bandi, na dunyuru dwandi dumabole. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Tumbe Djesu awu Nzambi amarambuse o dufu, dunyuru dwandi dusamabole.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39"/>Baane ba ngudji, djabanu yiri: mu djandi, dutandu du mabi dwidulonzulu. Mu djandi, mutu wotsu awimuvayili yitu, eghobulu mu mabi motsu, ame ne mighaghe mi Moyise mbé mighorungule utande. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Kaboghu, mbé dukebene yiri motsu amamabighu na babiyitsi makéduruyile. Djowu bamavose rye:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>“Tsunanu, djenu abe dubase na dilenze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Sutwanu na fwanu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Mu temu adji dukidubile monyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">nyuvaghe mwa yisalu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Yisalu ayi mbé dughorungule usinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ne mutu atsidutsingule yoni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Abk 1.5</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Ave Pole djone Barenabase bamapalilaange o ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife, batu bamabawivule yeri, mbé bomwérughe oyibalonze mambu meni, mu yilumbu yuvume. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Ave yibengunu yimasukile, baSwife bapwele na batu abamasinge Nzambi baSwife nomuyitse, bamayevetsighe Pole na Barenabase. Mu nzile, mubedji eni wumayenevosaange nowu, mu bawarise yiri bayakakene na yese yi Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Yilumbu yuvume ayimadukaange, batu botsu ba musyengi bamaghukeme mu yéwulu musamu wu mbembu Fumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Ave baSwife bamalabile mughungi, djowu bamabase na ngusu, mba bamatumune bakemi mu mambu motsu Pole amavosaange na bamamusyenge. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Yike Pole djone Barenabase bakebatsingule na musighe rye: «Mbembu Nzambi djimatindulu va téteghe ombu djenu baSwife. Tumbe dudjibusilaange, dwilasi yiri dughaduwelmine mudile monyu mutubu na mutubu! Adine djetu, tughéluyile yike ombu djowu abagha baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Djabeni Fumu eturumi ave evosili rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Nyimawubyatse nane yidjalale yi malongu masusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">mubeghe dughobutsu teno masukusulu ma butambe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49.6</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Ave bamadighululu, botsu abasamabe baSwife bakebase na nzangu, bakeyitsaange musamu Fumu. Na botsu abamasolu kale, mudile monyu mutubu na mutubu, bamavayile Djesu yitu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Musamu Fumu wumanyavaange mu bulongu bwotsu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Tumbe baSwife bakesibise bidjeti bi baghetu abamayitsaange Nzambi na bivunde bi musyengi. Djobotsu bakekwane Pole djone Barenabase, mba bakebasyanze o yinange yowu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Pole na Barenabase bakekuke difufundu di makulu mowu na bakewende o musyengi Yikonyome. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Yotsu yine, badukitsi abamabe o musyengi Antyose, bamabase na nzangu djineni na Yinyuni Yisyeme.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole na Barenabase o Yikonyome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>O Yikonyome wandi Pole na Barenabase bakekote o ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife. Bamasamune musamu Nzambi, lake baSwife na baNgereke bapwele bamasinge musamu Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Tumbe baSwife abasamasinge Nzambi, bakerombise matase mabive ombu djowu abasamabe baSwife, na bakebasibise bwé bakéwululu bango yitu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Tumbe dikalewube nane, Pole na Barenabase bamatsinge o musyengi Yikonyome. Bamasamunaange musamu Nzambi na musighe. Fumu amabaveghaange mangolu movaghe bimaghe na bilimbe bineni na makake mowu, mu ulase yiri, musamu awu bamalonzaange mu yese yandi, wungenze.<verse eid="ACT 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>O musyengi Yikonyome, vakebe dupasu va ghari yinombu yi batu ba musyengi. Bamosi bakebe o yari yi baSwife, mba bane o yari yi bilumbi. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Tumbe baSwife na bo basamabe baSwife na bivunde byowu bakekunzeme mukwane notinde mamani mu uboke bilumbi. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Djowu badidjabilaange, bakeyesweme o misyengi mi Likoni, Lisetere na Derebe, na mu mighule myowu. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Aghune, bakesamune Musamu Wuboti.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dubelusu du yikoyi o Lisetere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>O musyengi Lisetere wumabe yikoyi, yimaburu mambolutu, asamarungulaange uwende diteli. Matsane, <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>amawulu nane Pole amavosilaange. Pole anomughengile, akelabe yiri ane yitu yiwelimine yughobululu. <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>Pole akemutsingule rye: «Releme, sumbiti mu makulu maghu!» Yikoyi yeni akesundile ureleme na akevaghe mwa batake.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Mughungi wunolabe adi Pole amavaghe, wukevose o mbembu dji bise Likoni yi: «Banyambi bamabonge manyuru ma batu na bamavindeme ombu etu!». <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Bamanengile Barenabase «Sese», mumbari Sese amabe yivunde yi banzambi bowu. Pole bakemunengile «Yirmese», mumba amabe djandi omavosaange pwele. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Ndaghu dji nyambi Sese djimabe beli na dikotulu di musyengi. Anowulu mambu meni, muvaghulitsi paghu wu nyambi eni akebeghe bangombi abebamadwise na kembu, va wusu mughungi eni. Bamarondaange yi bangombi beni bakeveghu nane paghu ombu Barenabase djone Pole mu baghobise. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Bilumbi Pole na Barenabase, banodidjabe, bakepase bikutu byowu mu kevongule na bakesobene mu mughungi, noghamughe: <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>«Bambatsi betu, mubayi dwivayili nane? Tudji batu nane djenu. Twidubeyili Musamu Wuboti, muvaghe yiri dukesanze mutsanu enu. Mbé dusile bakosi abaghane tsongu, nosinge Nzambi-Pungu omasunde djulu, butambe, mubu na byotsu abivu mune. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Mu temu atsimavyoghe, Nzambi amasile malongu motsu wuyenewendaange kulini-kulini. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Ne vane, Nzambi asamadunde udulase maboti mandi. Adine, amadutindilaange mamvule na bivaru mu temu adjiwelimine. Amabwéduveghe bighudji na amabase mirime myenu na nzangu.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Yike bakale uvose nane, bilumbi bamalabe diweru dyughandise mughungi, bwé akébavaghulile paghu.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Va djulu vane, mwa baSwife bamosi bakerughesene o musyengi Antyose no Yikonyome, bakesibise mughungi mu kwane Pole djone Barenabase. Mba baketinde Pole mamani mu muboke. Na ditase yi Pole amafu, bakemudute mu mupalise o musyengi owu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Tumbe badukitsi banomukande, akereleme na akekote nowu o musyengi. Va kedi, akewende na Barenabase o musyengi Derebe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole djone Barenabase béghabuyi o musyengi Antyose dji Siri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Pole na Barenabase bamasamune Musamu Wuboti o musyengi Derebe, awu bamadilile badukitsi bapwele. Mba bakeghabughe o Lisetere, o Yikonyome na Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Bamayenewarisaange badukitsi, nobalonzaange ube na yikanene mu yitu ombu Nzambi. Na bamabwébalubusaange yi: «Tuvyolanu mu maghughe mapwele ne tukekote mu Bukaghe bu Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Mu kale dibundu bamababyatsile bivunde, mba yikebemani uwarile nzale nosambile, bakebawakise va makake ma Fumu adji bamavayile yitu.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Bakevyole o yinange yi Pisidi, na baketole o yinange yi Pafili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Banomane ulonze mbembu Nzambi o musyengi Perse, bamavindeme o musyengi Atali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Va djulu vane, bakenangeme mu watange mu wende o musyengi Antyose dji Siri, musyengi awu bamabyatsulu mu yese yi Nzambi dibandu yisalu ayi bamavaghe. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Banotole o Antyose, Pole djone Barenabase bakeghukighe dibundu. Bakebatsingule motsu ame Nzambi amavaghe mu kake mowu, na nane amaghobulile batu bapwele abasamabe baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Pole djone Barenabase bamavyose temu djineni va ghari badukitsi ba yinange yi Antyose.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yibengunu o Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Mwa batu bamarughesene o musyengi Sudé, baketole o musyengi Antyose. Djowu bamalonzaange baane ba tadji botsu, novose rye: «Pa dugharebu nane mughaghe Moyise wivosili, dughorungule ughobulu.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Pole na Barenabase basamasinge ame djowu bamavosaange, na bamatsunde nowu. Ladibandu, bamawulusunu yi Pole na Barenabase na bango yitu ba musyengi Antyose, mbé bowende o Serusaleme oyevose dyambu dyeni ombu bilumbi na bivunde bi dibundu. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Dibundu dimabaghanine nobasyende. Djowu bamavyoyile o yinange yi Fenisi teno Samari, noyenetsingulaange nane batu abasamabe baSwife, bamadilile duburu du ghone. Na dyoni, dimaveghe nzangu neni ombu baane ba ngudji botsu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Ave bamatolile o Serusaleme, bakesangulu na dibundu, na bilumbi na bivunde bi dibundu. Lake djowu bakebatsingule motsu ame Nzambi amadughusu nowu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Tumbe, mwa bamosi mu yinombu yi baFarisi, abamavayile Djesu yitu bamareleme. Djowu bamavose rye: «Bise malongu abagha baSwife vengu mbé borebu, nobaveghe dirume dyughobise mughaghe Moyise.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kake djimaghanu o Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Bilumbi na bivunde bi ndaghu Nzambi bikeghukeme mu ukelule dyambu dyeni. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Va djulu mutsundu eni wune, Pyere akereleme nobatsingule rye:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:7">«Baane ba ngudji, dwididjabi yi mu bilumbu abiteghe, Nzambi amanzole va ghari enu. Djandi amaronde yi ngalonze Musamu Wuboti ombu djowu abagha baSwife, bakewughuwulu na bakewusinge. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Na Nzambi, oyidjabi mirime mi batu, amabalase yiri ebasingi, na amabaveghe Yinyuni Yisyeme nane amavayile netu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Nzambi asamavaghe duvyakusunu va ghari djowu na djetu. Bano vayile Nzambi yitu akebalyomise mirime. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Mumbari yi dwimangili Nzambi? Dwirondi usunze mufune ewune mu masambeke ma badukitsi? Mufune awuwu, ne bakaaghe betu, ne djetubeni tusamarungule unangule! <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Mu dyoni, tune yitu yiri djetu botsu twighobululu mu yese yi Fumu Djesu, nane djowandi.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Yinombu yotsu yi batu yikevole «swii», mughulu Barenabase na Pole abamabatsingulaange bimaghe na bilimbe, abi Nzambi amadughusu nowu va ghari abasamabe baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Yike bévoli, Sake akebonge mbembu novose rye: «Baane ba ngudji, kulwetyanu! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Simewu amatutasise mwa dyambu: vane dibandu, Nzambi amasolile va ghari abasamabe baSwife, mukute awube wandi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Posulu babiyitsi djiwelmine na dyambu dyeni. Direndulu mu Bisonu rye:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>“Fumu Nzambi amavose yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Va djulu vane nyubwérughe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nyurelighe ndaghu Davide adjimaberughe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nyurungulile abimapanzighe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">nyudjikunze na djubwéreleme,<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>mba batu bamosi ba bulongu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">bakerombe Fumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Nine, mikute myotsu ami</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">nyimanengili mikebe myami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Lanu adi Fumu evosi.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Djandi amadughusu mambu meni mane, vane kale<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo 9.11-12</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Sake akebwévosi yi: «Lanu adi menu nyitasi: diwelemine yi tuyamwékambise abagha baSwife, abekaluyi dyele na uduke Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Tumbe tubarendisilyanu mughande, mu ubatsingule rye: “Duyabwebile udji banyame abaveghu nane paghu ombu bakosi. Silanu monyu wu nzoruru na bumbembu, duyabwebile udji banyame abaghaghewu kingu mu upalise malungu.” <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Vaghanu nane mumbari, ubandile vane kale, mu kale musyengi awu batu bélonzili mughaghe Moyise, mughaghe eni wirangu kale yilumbu yuvume mu mandaghu ma tsambu ma baSwife.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mughande wumatindulu bakereti abasamabe baSwife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Kaboghu, dimawelmine yiri bilumbi na bivunde, na dibundu dyotsu, bakesole va ghari owu, batu botinde na Pole djone Barenabase o musyengi Antyose. Bakesole baane ba tadji babedji va ghari bivunde bi dibundu: Silase na Sudase omanengulungu Barenabase, babaale bamaghobusungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Bakebaveghe mughande eni awumabe wusonughu nane:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Djetu bilumbi na bivunde bi dibundu tudji baane ba ngudji benu. Yike twidutindili mughande éwuwu, djenu baane ngudji betu abagha baSwife, djenu adwitsani o musyengi Antyose o yinange yi Siri na Silisi, mbolwanu! <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Tumawulu yi bamosi va ghari etu bamayédupupise mirime na posulu tsyowu. Yotsu yine, tsiri djetu tumabasindighe. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Ladibandu, tutsisolile batu bébane, nobasindighe ombu wenu na baane ba tadji betu ba murime, Barenabase na Pole. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Djowu abamasumbise monyu owu mu dine di Fumu etu Djesu Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Na twidutindili Sudase na Silase, aboyidutsingule na musighe, mambu mane mamosi ame tutsidurendili mu mughande eni wune. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Adine Yinyuni Yisyeme na djetubeni, tutsilabile yi tughobwérungule uduveghe mufune wumosi va djulu mambu meni ametumadurendili. Tumbe vengu, mbé dudedile mighaghe myeni mimi: <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>duyabwedji banyame abavaghulu ombu bakosi, silanu monyu wu nzoruru na bumbembu, duyabwebile udji banyame abaghaghewu kingu mu upalise malungu. Payi dutsivaghe nane mu byotsu bine, diwelimine yiri dutsisungighe. Kangwalyanu, yike vane wusu.»<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Banoghanine bise dibundu, bakewende o musyengi Antyose. Ave bamatolile wune, bakeghukighe dibundu dyotsu mba bakebaveghe mughande eni. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Mughande eni wukerangu, na botsu bamabase na nzangu, mu duwarusu adu bamadile mu motsu amamabe marendu mune. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Sudase na Silase, babilange djobeni babiyitsi, bamawamuse baane tadji na malongi mapwele, mu bawarise mu yitu yowu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Bamatsane nowu mwa temu, mba baane ba tadji yikebemani ubaveghe myule, bamabaghanine nobasile ughabughe ombu djowu abamabasindighe.[ <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Yike, Silase amaronde usyale o musyengi Antyose.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Pole na Barenabase bakesyale o Antyose. Djowu na batu bamosi, bamayenelonzaange mbembu Fumu nosamune Musamu Wuboti.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole na Barenabase békakunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Mwa temu djinovyoghe, Pole aketsingule Barenabase yi: «Twendi tughabuyi o uyélingule misyengi myotsu ami tumayenesamunine musamu wu Fumu, mu uyélabe nane baane ba tadji bakevu.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barenabase mbé aronde ubeghe nowu, San omanengulungu Mareke. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Tumbe Pole amadibuse, mumbari San Mareke djawandi, amabuse uwende nowu. Adine amakakenine nowu vo bamabile o yinange yi Pafili, mumbari amabuse ubawamuse mu yisalu yowu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Mutsundu wumabe wuneni va ghari owu, la dibandu bamakakenine. Barenabase akebonge Mareke nandi, bakenangeme mu watange na bakeyenewende o ningi dji Sipere. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Tumbe Pole akesole Silase, bakewakusu na baane ba tadji va makake na yese yi Fumu, mba bakeyenewende. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Bamavyoyile o yinange yi Siri na yo yi Silisi, noyenewarisaange yitu yi mabundu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Timote ewendi na Pole djone Silase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Pole aketole o misyengi mi Derebe na Lisetere. Vane vamabe mudukitsi dine dyandi Timote, ngudji andi mughetu muSwife awumasinge Djesu, tadji andi amabe muNgereke. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Baane ba ngudji bise Lisetere na Yikonyome, bamamughabusilaange bumbedji buboti. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Pole mbé aronde umubeghe nowu mu mulingu, adine amarebelu. Djandi amavayile nane, dibandu baSwife abamabe mu binange byeni, mumbari batu botsu bamadjabaange yiri tadji andi adji mwise Ngereke. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Mu misyengi myotsu ami bamayenevyoyilaange, bamenelonzaange baane ba tadji mighaghe ami bilumbi na bivunde bi Serusaleme bamabonge, na bamatsiyisaange mumbari mikeghobusu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Mabundu mamawarusungu mu yitu, na durangu dwowu dumaneghaange kale yilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole amalabe dulasu o musyengi Torwase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Pole na bambatsi bandi ba mulingu, bamavyoyile o yinange yi Firisi na o Ghalasi, mumbari Yinyuni Yisyeme yimabaghandise ulonze musamu Nzambi o yari yi Asi. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Ave bamatolile va mughule yinange yi Misi, bakedile ditase dyuwende o Bitini, tumbe Yinyuni yi Djesu yisamabagharusu. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Adine bamavyole kwase yinange yi Misi tenave bamayesunduyile o disabu di Torwase. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Va mukolu, Pole akebe na dulase. Akelabe sumbiti dibaale diteli, mwise Masedwane amamulendaange yi: «Vyoyile o Masedwane na rughe oyituwamuse!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Va djulu dulasu dweni, tumakunzeme mu uwende o Masedwane, mumbari tumalabe yiri Nzambi amatunengilaange wune, mu yésamune Musamu andi Wuboti.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">O musyengi Filipe, Lidi evayili Djesu yitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Yike, tunonangeme mu watange o Torwase, na tumawende sungingi o ningi dji Samotarase, mba yilumbu ayi mubedji, tumatole o musyengi Napolise. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Tunodusughe vane, tumawende o musyengi Filipe, musyengi wuteghe wu yinange yi Masedwane, awumabe otsi durumu du Rome. Tumavyose mwa bilumbu va musyengi eni.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, tumapale o musyengi mu wende o mughule mudjambe na ditase dyurasunu mbure adji batu bamasambililaange Nzambi. Tumatsane mu uvosile mwa baghetu, abamabe baghukeme vane. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Mughetu wumosi va ghari owu amanengulungu Lidi, mwise Tyatire. Djandi amabe kooli tsande tsiboti tsimabe tsibenge. Mughetu eni amayitsaange Nzambi, adine amatuwululuungu. Na Fumu amamudibule murime, mumbari akewulu na musighe mambu ame Pole amalonzaange. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Djandi amabatusu na batu botsu abamatsanaange mu ndaghu andi. Na amatunengile novose rye: «Payi dwitasi yiri menu wandi nyivayili Fumu yitu nane djenu, rughanu yitsananu mu ndaghu ami.» Amatunengile na yiswebiri na tumasinge uwende.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole na Silase bebwaghu o tsughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Mwa yilumbu, ave tumawendilaange o mbure dusambu, tumabengunu na musatsi mughetu munzambu, amabe na yinyuni yi mbome. Yinyuni yeni ayi amayenebiyilaange, nodilisaange mbongu tsipwele ombu bafumu bandi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Munzambu eni amayenetudukaange, Pole na djetu, na amayeneghamughaange yiri: «Batu bebabe basatsi ba Nzambi djulu! Djowu bodulonze nzile dughobutsu!» <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Dyambu dyeni dikebe yike nane yiswebiri bilumbu byotsu. Va disukusulu, Pole akenyoghe, akeghelughe na akenyangile yinyuni yibi novose rye: «Mu dine di Djesu Kirisete, nyiwurumi lenge nopale mu djandi!» Na yinyuni yibi yimapale va temu eni.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Vo bafumu ba munzambu eni bamalabile yiri mulilu owu wumatsyemughe, bakeghange Pole na Silase na bakebabeghe va mbure mughungi, va wusu fundu banzonzi mu utabule dyambu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Bakebabeghe va wusu banzonzi ba mighaghe na bakevose rye: «Batu bebabe bamayirombise dimbunge mu musyengi etu. Badji baSwife <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>na bélonzi mutsanu awughawuwelimine na mighaghe myetu, djetu abe tuvu bise Rome. Na tughane musughe wusinge vo wusalise moni.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Mughungi wukenyoyile Pole djone Silase. Banzonzi bamasindighe batu bakebavule bikutu, nobadimbise mikase. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Banomane wubadimbise, bakebabwaghe o tsughu na baketsingule mukelitsi tsughu, yiri akebakelisaange babindeme o ghari tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Anodile dirume dyeni, mukelitsi tsughu akebasunze o yibuku ayi ghari na akebavaghe makulu mu bivangu bi miri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bivangu bi miri: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">anane baghore ba Rome bamatungilaange bise tsugu owu.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Va ghari mukolu, Pole na Silase bamasambilaange na bamawimbilaange muyitse Nzambi. Botsu abamabe o tsughu bamabawulungu. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Vane-vane, butambe bukeregheme norakule yibughe yi ndaghu tsughu. Myune mi ndaghu myotsu mikedibughe na bapange ba bise tsughu botsu bakenyangughe. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Mukelitsi tsughu akerambughe. Anolabe yiri myune mi ndaghu mi tsughu midibughe, akedute didjenge dyandi mukéboke, mumbari amatase yi bise tsughu bamarine. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Tumbe Pole akebwaghe mughamu wuneni novose rye: «Wuyakéboke! Djetu botsu tudji vave!»<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Mukelitsi tsughu akevonde mutotu paghe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutotu paghe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">divindughulu mwinde</char></note>, akewemaswasu o tsughu noregheme, akekebwaghe va makulu ma Pole na Silase. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Akebapalise o yibuku yi ndaghu na akebawivule: «Bafumu bami, tsyeni nyurungule uvayile mu ughobughe?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Bakemuwaghule yiri: «Vayile Fumu Djesu yitu, wughobulu, ndedju na mukute aghu wotsu.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Mba bakebalonze musamu Fumu, djabeni na botsu abamabe mu ndaghu andi.<verse eid="ACT 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Mune mukolu eni, mukelitsi tsughu akebabeghe o ndawandi, akebasuse mapure na akebabughe. Vane-vane amabatusu, na mukute andi wotsu. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Mukelitsi amabeghe Pole na Silase o ndaghu andi, amalambise, bakedji va mosi. Djandi na mukute andi, bamabase na nzangu djineni mumbari bamasinge Nzambi djobotsu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Wisi anotebughe, banzonzi baketinde baghore mu uyétsingule mukelitsi tsughu yi: «Palise batu bebane.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Mukelitsi tsughu aketsingule Pole rye: «Banzonzi batsitinde musughe wududjeyise. Kabo tsyewendyanu na duvotsu.»<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Tumbe Pole akebawaghule rye: «Djowu batsitudimbise va ghari batu. Wendanu dukebatsingule, bamatubwaghe o tsughu ne bunzonzi uvaghu. Djetu abe tuvu bise Rome! Mba vave, bérondi utudjeyise yike o musweghe? Nesi! Baruyi djobeni mu uyitudjeyise!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Baghore baketsingule banzonzi mambu meni, na djowu bakeregheme, badjabilaange yiri Pole na Silase bise Rome. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Banzonzi bakerughe mu uyibavonde kokolu, bakebapalise o tsughu na bakebavaghe bwé bakedusughe musyengi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Banopale o tsughu, Pole na Silase bakewende ombu Lidi. Banomane uwarise baane ba tadji mu yitu, bamayenewende.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole djone Silase badji o musyengi wu Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Banovyoyile o misyengi mi Afipolise na Apoloni, Pole djone Silase bamatole o musyengi Tesalonike, tena ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Mu yuku yandi, Pole amakote o ndaghu dusambu. Kale yilumbu yuvumine, mu tsone yiryeru, amamoghe na amatsunde nowu mu dyambu di Bisonu bi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Adine amabavindiyilaange nobalonzaange nane Bisonu bi Nzambi, bimalasilaange na kengili yiri, Kirisete mbé otsoghusu, akeboku, mbana va djulu vane, mbé orambughe o dufu. Pole akebwébatsingule rye: «Djesu adji menu nyidulonzi, djandi la Kirisete.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Mwa pesu baSwife bakesinge musamu eni, bamasobene na Pole djone Silase. Vamabe yinombu yineni yi baNgereke bamabande uyitse Nzambi, baghetu bapwele wandi bamabe bidjeti.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Tumbe baSwife bakebase na ngusu. Bakeghukighe yinombu yi makwilisi bamarasunu mu mimbambe, bakesibisi dimbunge mu musyengi. Bakewende o ndaghu dji Sason mu yenerombe Pole na Silase, mubabeghe va wusu mukute. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Basamarasunu Pole na Silase. Ladibandu, bamabeyile Sason na baane ba ngudji bamosi va wusu bivunde bi musyengi. Bakeghamughe, novose rye: «Batu bebabe batsisisene bulongu, bamatole wunu! <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Sason amabadile ombu wandi! Batu botsu babe bésalisi na duvyakusunu du mighaghe mi kaghe Sesare, mumbari bévayi yi vadji kaghe mosi, djinengulu Djesu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Posulu eni, djikenyoyise mughungi na bivunde bi musyengi. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Sason na batu bandi bakefute yisingu yi dyambu ombu bivunde ne bakebasile.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole na Silase béwendi o musyengi Bere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Na mukolu witoli, baane ba tadji bakewendise Pole na Silase o musyengi Bere. Banotole, bakewende o ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Djobane bamabe na mutsanu wuboti tsinane baSwife ba Tesalonike. Bakedile Musamu Nzambi na durondu dwotsu. Kale yilumbu, bamakelulange Bisonu bi Nzambi mu ukelule yiri ame bamabatsingulaange mangenze. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Durangu duneni du batu bakevayile yitu, na va ghari baNgereke: pwele baghetu baghobe na babaale djowandi bakevayile Djesu yitu.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Tumbe ave baSwife ba Tesalonike bamawulu bwé Pole yike mbembu Nzambi elonzi o musyengi Bere wandi, bakesundili urughe mu yisibise dimbunge va ghari mughungi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Vane-vane, baane ba tadji bakewendise Pole o yari yi mubu. Silase na Timote bakesyale o musyengi Bere. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Pole, amabatsingule djowu abaménebeghaange yi Silase djone Timote batasunu mbangu-mbangu. Bakemutolise o musyengi Atene, mba bakeghabughe o musyengi Bere.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole evosili bise musyengi Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Temu adji Pole amakelisile Silase na Timote o musyengi Atene, amatsire murime mumbari musyengi wumabe wubase na bakosi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Amalonzaange baSwife o ndaghu dusambu na botsu abasamabe baSwife, tumbe bamadumaange Nzambi. Kale yilumbu, amayenelonzaange botsu abamenebengunu nandi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Balonzi ba dyele ba Pikire na ba Senu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Balonzi ba dyele ba Pikire na ba Senu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bise Ngereke bavu na dudjabu duneni.</char></note> bakerughe muyivose nandi. Bamosi bakevose rye: «Yivovi ayiyi! Yi erondi ututsingule vave?» Abane bakewaghule rye: «Etubuli banyambi ba beni!» Djowu bamavosile nane, mumbari Pole amasamune Musamu Wuboti wu Djesu na durambughulu o dufu.<verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Bakemubeghe nowu, tena va wusu fundu dji banzonzi ba musyengi owu, bamanengilaange «Yiropase». Bakemuwivule: «Turungule udjabe divindughulu di musamu éwuwu wughone witubeyili? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Mumbari yitutsinguli mambu maghone, na twirondi udjabe divindughulu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Bise Atene botsu na beni abamatsana o musyengi eni, temu djotsu yisalu yowu bu uvose vo uwulu musamu wughone.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Pole, diteli va ghari fundu dji Yiropase, akebonge mbembu: «Bise Atene, nyimalabe yiri dudji batu, abe bédjabi tinde wuyitse bakosi benu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Ave nyiyene vyengililaange mu mimbambe myenu, nyiyenelabaange bitumbe bi dighobe abidwiyitsi, na nzirasunu ne yinyenzulu yi paghu na yisonu yéyiyi: “Ombu nyambi adjighédjabunu.” Adji dwiyitsi mba dughedjidjabi, adjine menu nyiruyi oyidulonze.<figure style="fig" alt="Pole evosili bise musyengi Atene" file="WA03981b.tif" size="col" loc="17.16-34" copy="by Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="17.23"/> <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Nzambi, djandi omavaghe bulongu na byobivu mune, adji Fumu djulu na butambe, djandi aghetsani mu mandaghu amarungu na batu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Aghésalulu na makake ma batu, mba aghane nzale yisalu wotsu. Mumbari djandi oyiveyi botsu monyu, muvumu na byotsu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Mu mutu wumosi, amasunde mikute myotsu yiri djowu bakebase butambe bwotsu. Mu bufumu bwandi, Nzambi amasikighe yitsingu yi monyu, na bandilu ma mbure motsanine. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Nzambi amavaghe nane, yiri bakemurombe ne vadji diweru dyumulabe. Yotsu yine, Nzambi aghavale netu, <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>mumbari batu bévosi rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Mu djandi twivumini, twikungili, tubile monyu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Dyoni dimavosu na bivovi byenu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Djetu wandi tudji bakule bandi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Kaboghu tubilange bakule ba Nzambi, toghorungule ubaghusunu Nzambi na bakosi ba lore, ba madilu vo ba mamani, abitulu na matase ma batu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Nzambi aghékipi temu adji mbé bakamudjabile, tumbe erondi yiri batu botsu, mu mbure tsyotsu, bakesanze mutsanu na umughobise. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Mumbari Nzambi, amasikighe yilumbu ayi mutu awu djabeni amasole, ososisile batu botsu mu butambe mu dusungughu dwandi. Nzambi amalase kengili kake andi, ave amamurambusile o dufu.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Ave djowu bamawululu dyambu di batu abafu bwé boghabughe monyu, abane bamamupedji. Bamosi bamavose rye: «Djetu tuwuwululu mu dyoni temu susu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Na vane, Pole akebasile. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Va djulu vane, mwa dikabu di batu bamasobene nandi na bamakalughe bakereti. Mu yinombu yeni, vamabe dibaale dimosi mu fundu banzonzi bamanengilaange Deni, mughetu dine dyandi Damarise, na bamosi wandi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole amatole o musyengi Korinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Va djulu vane, Pole akeghusughe musyengi Atene mu wende o musyengi Korinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Akebengunu na muSwife dine dyandi Akilase, mwise Pon. Amabe na mughatsi andi Pirisile. Djowu mbé basekatsinge nobotughe o bulongu bu Yitali, mumbari kaghe Kolode amaveghe dirume ombu baSwife botsu bakedusughe musyengi Rome. Pole amasobene nowu, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>mumbari avu na yisalu yimosi nowu, bamarungaange masambe. Adine Pole amatsanine nowu, lake bakesalaange va mosi. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Kale yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Pole amalonzaange o ndaghu dusambu, na djandi amarombaange udute baSwife viri viri baNgereke ombu Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Ave Silase na Timote bamadusuyile o yinange yi Masedwane mu tole o Korinte, Pole akesingene yike na yisalu yusamunaange Musamu Wuboti wu Nzambi. Djandi akevindighaange va wusu baSwife yiri Djesu adji Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Tumbe baSwife bamabuse musamu awu Pole, amabasamuninaange na bamamusyenge. Kaboghu Pole amakuke difufundu di bikutu byandi na amabatsingule yi: «Malungu menu mabi mu myuru myenu! Menu nyisyeme. Mudjonge enu bakole. Ubandile na nyangu, nyuwende ombu djowu abagha baSwife.»<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Akebotughe vane na akewende ombu dibaale dine dyandi Tityuse Susutuse, amayitsaange Nzambi. Ndaghu wandi djimabe va mughule ndaghu dusambu dji baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Kirisepuse yivunde yi ndaghu dusambu, akevayile yitu ombu Fumu, na mukute andi wotsu. Batu bapwele bise Korinte, bamawululu Pole. Bakevayile yitu yowu mu Nzambi na bakebatusu.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Mukolu mosi, Pole akedile dulasu, mune Fumu emutsinguli didi: «Wuyala ghome. Tumbe bwela uvose, wuyavole: <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>nyidji naghu. Vagha mutu oghudimbise vo oghukambise, mumbari bapwele bavu bami mu musyengi ewuwu.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Pole aketsane yilime yimosi na yibuku o Korinte, amalonzaange ombu botsu musamu Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Mu temu adji Ghalyone amabilaange yivunde yi musyengi Rome mu yinange yi Akaye, baSwife bamawulusunu mu ufwengilile Pole. Bakemubeghe o ndaghu bunzonzi. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Baketubule yi: «Dibaale dyédidi erondi utsotse batu mu yitsaange Nzambi mu duvyakusunu du mughaghe etu.»<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Pole mbé aronde uvose, ave Ghalyone amawaghulili baSwife: «Djenu baSwife, mbé yi mutu atsiboke vo dyambu dibi atsivaghe, mbé nubo temu djuduwulu, notabule bunzonzi. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Tumbe dibila yiri, mutsundu mu dyambu di bighume, mine, vo di mughaghe djenubeni, dyoni didutsuni. Nyibusi ube nzonzi dji mambu nane!» <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Na akebapalise. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Kaboghu, botsu bakeghange Sosetene, yivunde yi ndaghu dusambu, na bakemudimbe va mune ndaghu mighaghe. Tumbe Ghalyone asamadilabe yi dyambu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole eghabuyi o musyengi Antyose dji Siri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Pole akesyale mu yitsingu o Korinte. Akekakene na baane ba ngudji, akenangeme mu watange djone Pirisile na Akilase na bakewende o Siri. Ne akebotughe musyengi, mu disabu di Senkire, amafughe muru, mumbari amava pangini ombu Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Banotole o musyengi Yifese, Pole akesile Pirsile na Akilase. Akewende o ndaghu dusambu na akevose na baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Djowu bakemuwivule usyale yitsingu, tumbe asamasinge. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Akebasile novose: «Nughabughe ombu wenu, pa Nzambi atsisinge.» Akenangeme mu watange mu botughe Yifese, na akewende. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Anotole o musyengi Sesaré, akelewé o Serusaleme musimbe dibundu, mba akewende o Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Akevyose mwa pesu temu o Antyose, mba akewende. Aketabe yinange yi Ghalasi na Firisi, mu warise yitu yi badukitsi botsu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolose elonzi batu o Yifese na o Korinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Mu temu édjine, vamabe muSwife dine dyandi Apolose, mwise Alesanderi, aketole o Yifese. Amabe dibaale dimavosaange na buketi, amadjabaange burange Bisonu bi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Amalongu mu dyambu di Nzile Fumu, amatubulaange nolonze na yusile yotsu mu dyambu di Djesu. Amalonzu yike musamu dubatusu du San. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Amavose na ngenze djotsu o ndaghu dusambu. Banomane umuwulu, Pirisile na Akilase bakemubonge mu mutsingule kengili Nzile Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Va djulu vane, Apolose amaronde uwende o Akaye. Baane ba ngudji bandi ba babaale na baghetu bakemuwarise mu dwendu dweni. Bakerende mughande ombu badukitsi ba yinange yéyine, yiri bakemudile ndilulu djiboti. Na etoli, amawamuse pwele, abamasinge Fumu, bakela ubwedji mu yese yi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Amavovene na baSwife mu ubuse mambu mowu va wusu batu botsu. Mu Bisonu bi Nzambi, amabalase yiri Djesu adji Kirisete.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole elonzi bise dibundu di Yifese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Temu adji Apolose abile o Korinte, Pole aketabe yinange yi mukongu na aketole o Yifese. Akerasunu badukitsi <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>na ewivuli: «Dutsidile Yinyuni Yisyeme, ave dutsivayile Fumu yitu?» Bakemuwaghule yi: «Vyaghe! Tukawulu uvose adi Yinyuni Yisyeme.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Kaboghu Pole akebawivule: «Dubatusu yi dumadile?» Bakewaghule: «Dubatusu du San.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Pole ebatsinguli: «San amabatise bobamasinge wukalughe mitsanu noghobise Nzambi. Amatsingule batu yiri: “Vayilanu yitu mu Djesu, owurughe va djulu ami.”» <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Banomane uwulu bighume byeni, akebabatusu mu dine di Fumu Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pole akesakighe makake mu djowu na Yinyuni Yisyeme yike baveghu. Bakevose mu mambembu masusu na bakebighe mu dikabu di Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Babaale beni bamabe dighumi na babedji (12) mu botsu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Kale yilumbu yuvume yi baSwife, Pole amawendaange o ndaghu dusambu. Mu ngondi yiryeru, amabonge mbembu na ngenze. Amavose mu Bukaghe bu Nzambi na amawarise ubawulusu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>BaSwife bamosi bamabuse uvayile yitu, bakepedji abamaduke Nzile Fumu va wusu dibundu. Mba Pole akekakene nowu, akenebeghe badukitsi nandi. Bilumbu byotsu akebavosilaange o ndaghu yinenge dji mutu, benengili Tiranuse. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Dyoni dimatsinge bilime bibedji. Va disukusulu, batu botsu abamatsana mu yari yi Asi, baSwife na bagha baSwife, bakeghulu musamu Fumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bane ba Seva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Nzambi amadughusu bimaghe bineni mu makake ma musatsi andi Pole. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Bamasunzaange miswari vo bikutu abimabembaange dunyuru dwandi mu bibedu. Bibedu byeni bimabelughaange mu mali mowu na binyuni bibi bimapala mu djowu.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>BaSwife bamosi, bamawendaange mbure na mbure mu syanze binyuni bibive. Bamaronde usyanze binyuni bibive mu dine di Fumu Djesu. Bamatsingula binyuni bibi: «Nyiduve dirume, dupale mu dine di Djesu adji Pole etubuli!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Vamabe yivunde yimosi yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu ba baSwife, dine dyandi Seva. Yisambwali yi bane bandi, djowu bamavaghe mambu meni. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Tumbe yilumbu yimosi yinyuni yibi yimabawaghule: «Nyidjabi Djesu na nyidjabi anyi avu Pole. Tumbe djenu, bani duvu?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Na djandi omabe na yinyuni yibi, akekébwaghe mu djowu mu lase yi abavyoghulile djobotsu mangolu. Amabatsoyise na bukani, na bakerine ndaghu eni, peni-wangi na mapure.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Adimavyoghe dimadjabunu na bise Yifese. BaSwife na baNgereke bamabase na ghome, bakedjabe durumu du Nzambi na buneni bu dine di Fumu Djesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Bapwele abamavayile yitu, bamarunga mu yidjabise mabi ame bamavaghaange. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Yinombu yeni yi batu ayimasalise ngalu, bamabeghe mabuku mowu na bamamanyenze va wusu batu botsu. Tumatale dufunu du mabuku meni: dumaveghe dighumi di senzu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">senzu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fute dji yilumbu yimosi yi bisalu.</char></note>(50 000) tsi mbongu. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>La nane mu mangolu ma Fumu, musamu wumanyavaange na wumalasaange mangolu mapwele.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupuki o musyengi Yifese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Va djulu mambu meni, Pole akeghane kake djutabe Masedwane na Akaye, nowende o Serusaleme. Amavose nane: «Nyinowende, mbé nyutole o musyengi Rome wandi.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Aketinde o yinange yi Masedwane Timote na Yirase, abamasala yisalu yowu nandi. Tumbe amasyale djabeni mwa temu o yari yi Asi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Va temu eni, vamabe kimbu djineni o Yifese, dibandu djowu abameneduka Nzile Fumu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Vamabe mutulitsi bapange, dine dyane Demeteyuse, amavaghe mandaghu magheyi ma nyambi owu mughetu, dine dyandi Artemise. Mandaghu meni mamavegha madile mapwele ombu batulitsi botsu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Akebaghukighe, na botsu abedjabi yisalu nane yine, na akebatsingule: «Bambatsi, dwidjabi yi maboti meruyili mu yisalu yéyiyi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Tumbe dwilabi na dwiwulu adivyoyi: mutu awu bénengili Pole etubuli yiri, banyambi abevaghu na makake ma batu, bagha banyambi bangenze! Aborungule ubembe bapwele tsike bu ghunu o Yifese, tumbe na mu yari yetu yotsu yi Asi. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Dyoni mbé dyubivise yisalu yetu, notsyemuse didume di ndaghu nyambi etu Artemise, obeyitsi mbure tsyotsu mu yari yi Asi na mu bulongu bwotsu.»<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Mu mambu meni, abamawulu bakebase na kabu na bakeghamughe: «Yivunde djandi, Artemise dji bise Yifese!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Mupuki wukedughunu mu musyengi wotsu. Batu bakenebeghe Ghayise na Arisitareke, bise Masedwane babedji, bamabe nandi mu mulingu na Pole. Yinombu yikewé mbangu o mbure bibengunu bi mighungi. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pole amabe na nzale ulabene va wusu yinombu, tumbe badukitsi bakemughandise. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Bidjeti bi Asi bamabe bambatsi bandi, bakemutindile yilumbi yumutsingule, akéwende o mbure bibengunu bi yinombu.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Mu temu eni, dibundu bamabe mu nkumfu. Basusu bamaghamugha dyambu dimosi, bamosi dimosi. Bapwele va ghari owu basamadjabaange dibandu yi bamaghukimine. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>BaSwife bamasindighe mutu o wusu, dine dyandi Alesandere. Akenangule dikake mu votse yinombu, mubavosile nobonge dikabu di baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Tumbe na batu bédjabi yiri muSwife, bakeghamughe djobotsu va mosi mu maweru mabedji: «Yivunde djandi nyambi Artemise dji bise Yifese!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Anomanisile, yirende-rende yi musyengi akerungule usiyighe yinombu novose: «Bise Yifese, batu botsu bédjabi yi bise Yifese bakelitsi ba ndaghu Artemise, yibaghunu yandi yibonduyi o djulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Vagha mutu wughale. Mu dyoni, mbé dusigheme notase ne duke salise. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Dutsibeghe vave batu abaghabunge nosyenge Nzambi etu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Pa Demeteyuse na bambatsi bandi ba bisalu bane mufundu na mutu, bawendi ombu banzonzi aborungule utabule dyambu. Babeyi mufundu ghune. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Na pa dune dyambu dimosi duvu na nzale ulase, tudinonze va ghari dibundu adiwelmine. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Mbé tufwengululu yiri tudji mimbini, mu dyo ditsivyoghe na nyangu, mbé tughorungule ukekaghule. Va djulu mambu meni, akekungise mughungi.»<verse eid="ACT 19:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole eruyi o mulingu andi o Masedwane na Ngerese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Musighe wunoghabughe, Pole akeghukighe badukitsi nobawarise, mba akebaghanine nowende o Masedwane. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Akesabughe yari yeni, nowarise bakereti bapwele ave amavosilaange nowu. Va djulu vane, akewende o Ngerese <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>o amatsanine miweli miryeru. Mbé aronde unangeme mu watange nowende o Siri, ave amawululu yi baSwife bamamutungile fundu. Kaboghu, akesitighe muvyoyile adu Masedwane. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Batu abamawendaange nandi: Sopate mwane Pirise mwise Bere, Arisitareke Sekunduse bise Tesalonike, Ghayise mwise Derebe, Timote, Tisike na Torfime bise yari yi Asi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Bane bakerele notukele o musyengi Torwase. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Yoyine djetu tumanangeme mu watange, mu wende o Filipe, yike mumengu wu bapembi abaghane dufunusu wisuki. Bilumbu biranu va djulu, tumabadale o Torwase o tumavyosile tsone mosi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulingu musitu wu Pole o Torwase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Mu yilumbu yiteghe yi tsone, tumabe tughukeme mudji va mosi. Pole amalonze dibundu, amavose pwele tena ghari wisi, mumba mbé owende va kedi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Balambi bapwele bamabe o kilingu ndaghu adjitumabe. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Mwa munzambu wumanengulungu Yitikise amatsane va nele ndaghu. Akewende yilu yineni ave Pole amavosila. Yilu yimavyoghulile, tena ave amabonduyile kilingu adji muryeru teno tsi. Akefu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Pole akevindeme, akemunaghule novose yi: «Dundanu wunyonge, adji monyu.» <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Mba akemate, akeghabe pembi nodji. Yike emani akemwévose tinde yitsingu tena kedi, mba akewende. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Bakeghabuse munzambu monyu na dyoni dikebe tinde duwarusu ombu botsu.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole eruyi o Torwase tena o Mile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Tumarele uwende mu watange adjimatubeghe o musyengi Asose, o mbé tubongile Pole. Anane amakinzile, mumba amabe na nzale uwendile mu mumbambe. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Anoturasene o Asose, tukemunangighe mu wende o musyengi Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Vane, tukewende mu watange. Yilumbu ayimaduke tukebambene na ningi Kyo. Yilumbu yi djulu, tuketole o ningi Samose, mba ayinzime tukedale musyengi Mile. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Pole, asamaronde usikeme o musyengi Yifese, mumba diweru dikévyoghe o yari yi Asi. Amavungilaange utole o Serusaleme, pa mbé dyurungule ube yilumbu yi Patekote.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole evosi na bivunde bi Yifese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>O musyengi Mile, Pole aketinde yilumbi o dibundu di Yifese mu yélande bivunde byowu. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Banotole va mughule andi, akebatsingule yi: «Dwidjabi nane nyimatsanine nenu, ubongile va yilumbu yiteghe ayi nyimaruyile o yari yi Asi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Nyimasalile Fumu na divole-mbombu, na matsange na maghughe amenyimalabe dibandu bikumbu bi baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Dwidjabi yi nyisamasweghe ne dimosi mu motsu amawelimine. Nyimadulonze notsingule motsu, na va ghari batu na mu mandaghu menu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Nyimanengile baSwife na baNgereke mukalughe dyele na Nzambi, novayile Fumu etu Djesu yitu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Mba vave, yike o Serusaleme nyiwendi, nane Yinyuni Yisyeme yinzindiyili. Tumbe, ngedjabi adyutuyile ghune. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Nyidjabi yi mu kale musyengi, Yinyuni Yisyeme yindubusi yiri, tsughu na maghughe bikeli. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Tumbe, monyu ami wughane tsongu va wusu ami. Adimbuli murime, uwende teno disukusulu mu manisile yisalu ayi Fumu Djesu amapeghe. Diwendili rye: wulonze Musamu Wuboti wu yese yi Nzambi.»<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Nyimavyose temu nolonzange Bukaghe bu Nzambi, tumbe nyimadjabe yi vagha ne wumosi va ghari enu omwéndabe. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Ladibandu, nyidubongili na muni nane bambedji: yike wumosi va ghari enu etsyemuyi, nga mune dighénzuni. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Mumba nyimadulonze motsu ame Nzambi amasitighe, ne dimosi nyisamasweghe. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Dukebene djenubeni, na kelisanu mughambe, awu Yinyuni Yisyeme amaduveghe. Bandekenanu dibundu di Nzambi adi amadile mu malungu ma mwane andi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Nyidjabi yi ave nyuwendile, batu bavu nane baminzi ba bukani bokote va ghari enu mba mughambe wughovengusu. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Mba ne va ghari enu, batu bofuraange mu dute badukitsi. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Moghanu kaboghu! Rangeminanu yi, mu bilime biryeru, na nyangu na mukolu, nyisamadunde ulile mu ulubuse kale mutu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Vave, nyiduwakise ombu Nzambi na musamu wu yese yandi. Ane musughe uduwarise mu yitu, noduveghe disyale adi asweyile bandi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Nyisamavonde badoli na lore, vo bikutu bi wotsu ke mutu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Dwidjabi yi nyimasale na makake mami, mu dile abimabe biwelimine na abamandukaange. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Nyimadulase mu motsu yusale abwedji mu wamuse abadede. Mbé turangiminanu ame djabeni Fumu Djesu amavose: “Uveghe atsivyo uveghu nzangu.”»<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Yike emani uvose, Pole akekuteme nowu nosambile. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Botsu bamalile pwele na matsange mu misu, bakevyunge Pole mu kingu nomughumbesene. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Bamaningaange mumba Pole amavose yi aghoghabughe. Bakeyemuvetsighe tena o watange.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole ewendi o Serusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Tunokakene nowu, tukesungeme o ningi Kose mu watange, yilumbu ayimadukaange tuketole o ningi Rode. Yilumbu ayimaduke tukewende o ningi Patare. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Tumadale watange djimawendaange o yinange yi Fenisi, tumabwénangeme noyenewende. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Tunolabilile ningi Sipere, tumavyole o maghetu mu wende o yari yi Siri. Tukesikeme o musyengi Tire o watange djimabe na mufune wusunduse. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Tumarasene badukitsi na tumatsane tsone nowu. Banolubusu na Yinyuni Yisyeme, bamaghandise Pole uwende o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Tumbe tsone eni djinovyoghe, tukebongulile nzile. Djowu botsu bakétuvetsighe, na baghetu na bane, teno dikotulu di musyengi. Tuke kuteme va disimu di mubu nosambile Nyambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Tunoghanesene kale mutu, tumanangeme mu watange. Djowu bamaghabughe mu mimbu mowu.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Tumamane disabu dyetu, urambuyile o Tire teno musyengi Tolemayise. Tunomane usimbe baane ba ngudji o musyengi eni, tuketsane nowu yilumbu yimosi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, tukesogheme notole o musyengi Sesaré. Vane, tukekote o ndaghu Filipe, musamunitsi wu Musamu Wuboti na tuketsane ombu wandi. Amabe wumosi va ghari yisambwali yi batu, abamasolu o Serusaleme mu wamuse bakwili. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Amabe na baane bana ba baghetu bamabe batsyemi, bamabighaange.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Mbé tuke bilumbu bipwele vane, ave mubiyitsi winengulu Aghabise amaruyile o Sudé. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Akebambene netu, akebonge beleti dji Pole, akekétunge makulu na makake na djoni novose yi: «La adi Yinyuni Yisyeme evosi: “Fumu beleti adjidji otungu nane na bivunde bi baSwife ba Serusaleme, mba bomuwakise ombu beni.”»<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Tunowulu mane, djetu na baane ba ngudji ba Sesaré tumalende Pole akéwende o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Tumbe akewake yi: «Mumba yi dililili nondetse manyuru? Nyikunzeme mutungu na muboku o Serusaleme dibandu Fumu Djesu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Dibilaange yi tusamarungule umusanze ditase dyandi, tumadunde utsiyise novose yi: «Durondu du Fumu duvaghu.»<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Mwa bilumbu binovyoghe, tukekunzeme nomate o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Badukitsi ba Sesaré bamawende netu, baketutsanise ombu Nasone, mwise Sipere, awumabe mudukitsi vane kale.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole eyélabe Sake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Ave tumatolile o Serusaleme, baane ba ngudji bamatusangile na nzangu. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Pole akewende netu ombu Sake, o bivunde byotsu bi dibundu bimaghukemine. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Pole akebasimbe nobatsingule bikumbu byotsu nane Nzambi amasalile ombu abagha baSwife.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Banomuwulu bakedodise Nzambi. Mba bakevaghe Pole yi: «Wilabi, mwane-ma, tosini kwe tsi baSwife bamasinge Djesu. Djobotsu baname na Mughaghe Moyise. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Yotsu yine la adi bamabatsingule: “Wilongi baSwife botsu abetsani va ghari malongu masusu, yi badundi Mughaghe wu Moyise. Wibatsinguli yi bayamwérebaange baane bowu na bayamwéduke mighulu mi djetu baSwife.” <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Tsyé tuvale? Bodjabe yi wumarughe. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Kaboghu, vaghe adi tiwutsinguli. Vave, vadji babaale bane netu batsi leve pesi ombu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Babeyi, djenu botsu yétsyemuswanu va wusu Nzambi. Fute byotsu mumbari bakefughu myuru. Pa dutsivaghe nane, batu botsu bodjabe yi vagha ngenze mu adi batsiwuvosile, tumbe ndewandi wighobisi mughaghe Moyise. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Mu bise malongu abamasinge Djesu, tutsibarendisile mu batsingule yi: bayabwedji banyame atsivaghulu ombu bakosi vo banyame atsighaghewu kingu mu palise malungu, mba bayavaghe bumbembu.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Pole akebeghe batu beni babane bakekésyemise djobotsu. Akewende o ndaghu Nzambi notsingule yilumbu ayi bovaghulile paghu na dutsyemusu du mutu-mutu dusukile.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole amaghangu o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Yisambwali yi bilumbu mbé yike usuke, ave baSwife ba yari yi Asi bamalabile Pole o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi. Bakenangule mughungi wotsu, bakemughange, <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>noghamughe yi: «BaYisrayele, tuwamusyanu! La mutu awilonzi batu botsu mbure tsyotsu dilongi di kondenyonde na mukute Yisrayele, mughaghe etu na mbure djisyeme. Amakotise ne abagha baSwife mu mbure édjidji na bamadjibivise.»<verse eid="ACT 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Pa bamadisalise, mbari bilumbu abiteghe bamalabe Torfime mwise Yifese djone Pole bamayenewendaange mu musyengi Serusaleme. Bamasingene yi Pole amamukotise o dulombili du baSwife, tumbe bamabe na mbele. <verse eid="ACT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Dimbunge dikelave mu musyengi wotsu, mba batu bakepalile yari na yari na bakeghukeme. Batu bakeghange Pole, nomupalise o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi, adji bamalenge nobindighe dikotulu.<verse eid="ACT 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Mbé baronde uboke Pole, mu temu eni abemoyi bamayétsingule yivunde yi baghore ba Rome, yi Serusaleme djotsu ukunge djikungi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Vane-vane yivunde akebonge baghore na bivunde byowu, nowende mbangu o mughungi. Banolabe yivunde, bakedunde udimbe Pole. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Yivunde akebambene nandi, akemughangise nomutungise na pange bedji. Mba akewivulu dine dyandi na dyambu adi amavaghe. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Tumbe mu mughungi, abéba bamaghamughaange didi, bane bamaghamughaange disusu. Yivunde mbé aghorungule ughangise dyambu na tsikiri dibandu nkumfu. Akeveghe dirume dyubeghe Pole o ndaghu baghore. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Pole anotole vo bande yikadi, baghore bakemunangule, dibandu dikani di mughungi. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Mumba batu bapwele bamamudukaange, noghamughe yi: «Afu!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole ekeghanze va wusu mughungi baSwife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Ave bamakotisilaange Pole o ndaghu baghore, akevaghe yivunde yi: «Nine musughe uvose mwa dyambu?» Yivunde amasutu, nomuwivule yi: «Widjabi uvose mbembu baNgereke? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Kaboghu wughaa mwise Yisipete awumarombise didjunge, nobeghe tosini-djina (4 000) tsi batu na bitoghulu byowu o kumu dji ghumughe?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pole amawaghule yi: «Menu muSwife, uburulu o Tarese dji Silisi, mutsighe musyengi awughélibunu. Kokolu tsyaghu, singe ngavose na mughungi.»<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Yivunde akemusingile dyoni. Pole, diteli va djulu yikadi, akesambe dikake ombu mughungi mudile duvotsu. Botsu bakevole «swii», mba akebavosile mu mbembu baEberu.<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>Pole akevose na mughungi yi: «Djenu duvu mukute wumosi nami, tséwulwanu adingivose mu kékaghule.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Banowulu yi ebavosili mu mbembu baEberu, bakebwele usigheme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Kaboghu Pole akeghamughe: <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Nyidji muSwife, uburulu o Tarese dji Silisi. Tumbe nyimabanguyile vave Serusaleme, na nyimalongu na Ghamalyele omandonze mughaghe ba tadji betu na tsikiri. Nyimabe na yusile mu dyambu di Nzambi, nane duvu na muni. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Nyimakwane abamadukaange Nzile Fumu teno dufu. Nyimatinde baghetu na babaale o tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na fundu djotsu dji bivunde bi mukute, borungule ughabuse bumbedji yi dingenze nyivosi. Djobeni bamapeghe ne mighande mi musughe muyéveghe baane ba ngudji ba baSwife ba Damase. Nyimawende o musyengi eni mughange badukitsi ba Nzile Fumu abamabe wune, nobabeghe batungu o Serusaleme mu bakilise.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>Va mwangulu ave nyangu ebile va djulu muru, nyimabe mu nzile beli na Damase. Suke, yidjalale yineni ayimarambuyile o djulu yimankandile va mbure adji nyimabe. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Nyimaberughe vatsi nowulu dyufi dimavose yi: “Sole, Sole, dibandu yi winkwanini?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Nyimawivulu yi: “Nde la nyi, Fumu?” Akekwaghule yi: “Menu la Djesu mwise Nasarete, awu wikwani.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Abamabe nami bamalabe yidjalale, tumbe basamawulu dyufi di djandi omavosaange.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Nyimamuwivulie rye: “Yi nyuvaghe, Fumu?” Fumu amapaghe yi: “Releme, wende o musyengi Damase. Mba vane bowutsingule motsu ame wuvaghe.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Dibilaange yi yidjalale yeni yimapaghe yidunge, abamabe konge nami, bamankaange mu dikake teno musyengi Damase.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>Vane vamabe Nanyase, dibaale dimaghobisaange Nzambi nodedile mughaghe. BaSwife botsu ba Damase bamamughobisaange. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Amayitasene, akebe va mughule ami nopaghe yi: “Sole, mwane ngu ami, bongulile ulabe!” Vane temu eni, ngamwélabe. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Amabwele yi: “Nzambi bakaaghe betu amawusole kale wukedjabe durondu dwandi, na wukelabe djandi o Asungeme nowulu dyufi dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Mumba wube mbedji andi va wusu batu botsu, mu wanze adi wutsilabe nowulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Ka mumba yi wumwékelise? Releme, batusu notandu mabi maghu, nonengile dine dyandi.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole etubuli nane amatindu ombu mikute misusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Nyimaghabughe o Serusaleme, yoyine nyimasambilaange o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi, ngadile dulasu du Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Nyimalabe Fumu omanzingule yi: “Lenge noghusughe Serusaleme, mumba abetsani wune baghosinge bumbedji bwaghu mu menu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Menu nyimawake yi: “Fumu, bédjabi yi nyimawendaange mu mandaghu motsu ma tsambu ma baSwife, mu dimbise bango yitu mu ndedju, nobatinde o tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Mba ave malungu ma mbedji awu Yityene mamadekila, me wa nyimabe vane. Nyimasingisile abamamubokaange, nyimakele ne bidwaru bi abamamuboke.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Fumu amanzingule yi: “Wende, mumba nyuwutinde vale, ombu mikute misusu!”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yivunde yi baghore ewivuli Pole byuvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Mughungi wuke wulu Pole tena posulu djusite. Mba botsu bakeghamughe: «Tutsyemusyanu mutu eni wughu! Afu! Asawelemine utsane va butambe bwébubu!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Bamaghamughaange, bakevulaange bikutu byowu, mba baketindaange difufundu na djulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Yivunde yi baghore akeveghe dirume dyukotise Pole o ndaghu baghore nomudimbe mikase, mumba akevose mu udjabe dibandu yi mughungi wimughamuyili. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Tumbe ave bamamutungile mu umudimbe, Pole akewivule yivunde ayimabe vane yi: «Dune musughe wu udimbe mwise Rome mikase, awughaa ne wufundusu?»<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Na ewulu nane, yivunde yi baghore akelubuse yivunde yandi: «Akemuvaghe yi tsyé wuvale? Dibaale dyédidi mwise Rome!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Yivunde yi baghore akeyilabe Pole nomuwivule yi: «Nzinguli, ngenze wudji mwise Rome?» Pole akewaghule yi: «Yine.» <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Yivunde yi baghore akewake yi: «Nyimaveghe mbongu tsipwele mu udile musughe wunengulu “mwise Rome”.» Tumbe Pole akevose yi: «Menu mwise Rome mu duburulu dwami.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Suke, abe mbé baronde umudimbe mu umuvosise, bakekakene nandi. Djabeni yivunde yi baghore akebe na ghome, ave amadjabile yi amatungise mwise Rome na bapange.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole va wusu fundu banzonzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Yivunde yi baghore amabe na nzale udjabe tsikiri adibamafwengilile Pole. Ladibandu, va kedi amamunyangulile nonengile bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na fundu djotsu dji banzonzi ba baSwife. Mba akebeghe Pole va wusu owu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pole akesikighe yiswisu mu fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife, novose yi: «Bane ba tadji, na matase malyome, nyisalili Nzambi tena na muni.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu Ananyase, akeveghe musughe ombu bobamabe beli na Pole, wumudimbe mu munu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Kaboghu Pole akevaghe yi: «Nzambi aléwudimbe, na deti aghu! Wutsane vane mu ufundise nane mughaghe wirondili, mba wumabise mughaghe noveghe mu usughe wu undimbe!»<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Abamabe va mughule Pole, bakemutsingule yi: «Yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu yi Nzambi wisyengi!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Pole akewaghule yi, «Bane ba tadji, ngadjabaange yi yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu. Ngenze, Bisonu bi Nzambi bivosi yi: “Wughovose dibi mu yivunde yi mukute aghu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Ukm 22.27</ref></char></note>!”» <verse eid="ACT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Pole amadjabaange yi fundu djimabe djibase yari ayéyi baFarisi, yari ayine baSadisi. Ladibandu, amaghamuyile va wusu fundu dji banzonzi: «Bane ba tadji, nyidji muFarisi, mwane muFarisi. Nyifundusulu, mumba nyivu na yitu mu durambughulu du abafu.»<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Mbé asekamane ne uvose, baFarisi na baSadisi bakebande utsunde, mba vakebe dupasu va ghari owu. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>BaSadisi, bévosi yi vagha durambughulu o dufu, bemwévose yi vagha byanze na binyuni. Yotsu yine, baFarisi bémasingi yi mangenze. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Mighamu yike la viri. Milonzi mi mighaghe, abamabe na baFarisi, bakereleme notsunde na yikanene: «Tughélabi dibi mu mutu éwuwu. Tangudji yinyuni vo yanze yitsimuvosile?»<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Mutsundu wukevyoghulile, tena yivunde yi baghore amawulu ghome bakéboke Pole. Ladibandu, amaveyile baghore bandi dirume dyuyébapatule Pole, nomughabuse o ghari ndaghu baghore. <verse eid="ACT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Mukolu awumaduke, Fumu akelabene na Pole nomutsingule yi: «Ware! Wutsikabusile bumbedji o Serusaleme, na diwelimine wukelase bumbedji o musyengi Rome wandi.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">BaSwife bamatunge fundu djubokile Pole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Va kedi adjimaduke, baSwife baketunge fundu. Bakeleve pesi yi baghodji vo unu, pa bakaboke Pole. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Abamatunge fundu eni, bamabe bavyoghe maghumi-mana (40). <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Bakérasene bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na bivunde bi baSwife, mu batsingule yi: «Tutsileve pesi va wusu Nzambi yi tughodji yisalu, pa tukaboke Pole. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Kaboghu, djenu na fundu djotsu dji banzonzi, vaghanu yivunde yi baghore akebeghe Pole, dukefure yi dwirondi ukelule dyambu dyandi na burange. O yetu yari, tukunzeme mu muboke ne aketole vave.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Tumbe mwane-katsi Pole, mwane yibusi yandi, amawulu fundu eni. Akewende o ndaghu baghore, akekote nolubuse Pole. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Kaboghu Pole akenengile yivunde yi baghore yimosi nomuvaghe yi: «Beghe munzambu éwuwu ombu yivunde, mumba ane mwa dyambu erondi umutsingule.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Yivunde akemubeghe ombu yivunde yandi, novose yi: «Mwise tsughu winengulu Pole, atsipaghe nga wubeyile munzambu eni wuwu, mungo dyambu dyuwutsingule.»<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Yivunde yi baghore akebonge munzambu mu dikake, akevengeme nandi nomuwivule yi: «Yi wirondi unzingule?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Akewake yi: «Bidjeti bi baSwife batsiwulusunu mu wuwivule yi wukebeghe Pole mughese va wusu fundu djotsu dji banzonzi. Bofure yi bérondi uwulu dyambu dyandi burange. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Tumbe wuyabavayile yitu! Mumba abémutungili fundu bavyoghe ne maghumi-mana (40) ma batu. Batsileve pesi va wusu Nzambi yi baghodji vo unu, pa bakamuboke. Bamakunzeme na békeli yike musughe aghu.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Yike emani urume munzambu yi ayavose dyambu dyeni na mutu, yivunde yi baghore akemughabuse.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Mba yivunde yi baghore akenengile batsyengi bandi babedji nobarume yi: «Ghukighanu kame-bedji (200) tsi baghore, na maghumi-dusambwali (70) ma babeyitsi ba bibulu na kame-bedji (200) tsi babaale na makongu, na banu djenu botsu na dubayi duwende o Sesaré, va maweru maryéru ma tsisighe. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Kunzanu bibulu duke beghe Pole na burange ombu yivunde yami Felikese.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Mba akerende mughande eni wughu: <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Menu Kolode Lisyase, nyiwutindili mughade ewuwu mundumbe Felikese. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Dibale dyédidi, BaSwife batsighaange mbé baronde umuboke, kaboghu tutsimupatule na baghore bami va makake mowu, mumba nyimawulu yi adji mwise Rome. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Nyimaronde udjabe dibandu adi bamamufwengililaange, ngamubeghe va wusu fundu dji banzonzi ba baSwife. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Nyimaghulu yi bémufwengilili mu mighaghe mi djobeni, tumbe aghane mbele dufu vo dji tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Mba nyilubusi yi vadji fundu bamutungile. Nzilenge nomutinde ombu waghu na nyivayi bambeni bandi bakeyimufunde va wusu aghu.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Baghore bakededile marume ame bamadile. Bakebonge Pole nomubeghe mukolu o musyengi Atipareti. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, baghore abamabe mu makulu bakeghabughe o ndaghu owu, nosile babeyitsi ba bibulu uwende na Pole. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Na bétoli o Sesaré, babeyitsi ba bibulu bakeveghe yivunde mughande, nomuwakise Pole va makake mowu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Dipateme anomane urange mughande, akemuwivule yari yi dimbu dyandi. Anowulu yi mwise Silisi, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>akemuvaghe yi: «Nyuwusosise pa bambeni baghu bamarughe.» Na akeveghe musughe wukelise Pole o ndaghu kaghe Yirode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole efwengululu ombu Dipateme Felikese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Bilumbu biranu binovyoghe, yivunde yi bavaghulitsi ba paghu Ananyase, amarughe o musyengi Sesaré. Amarughaange va mosi na bivunde bi baSwife, na nzonzi mosi omanengulu Tertuluse. Bamayikelase ombu Dipateme Felikese mu ufunde Pole. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Pole amanengulu, nzonzi Tertuluse akemufwengilile mu mame. Akevose yi: «Mundumbe, mu yese yaghu tubile na duvotsu duneni, na mu dyele di durumu dwaghu, mambu makaluyile burange mu bulongu bwébubu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Mu byotsu abi twidili temu tsyotsu, twiwughabusili diboti dyneni. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Ngérondi wuvyosulile mu diweru dyaghu. Ladibandu, nyighulendi mu maboti maghu, mu utuwulu mwa pesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Tutsikelule dibaale dyédidi na erombisi kindu. Abilaange yivunde yi mimbini mi dibuli di Nasarete, erombisi mbulighe ombu baSwife botsu ba bulongu. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Atsiwélighe ubivise ndaghu Nzambi na tutsimughange. [Tutsironde umusosise mu mughaghe etu, <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>tumbe yivunde Lisyase amarughe. Aketupatule woni na mangolu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Aketuvaghe yi tukemufunde va wusu aghu.] Pa wumuwivule, wulabe ndebeni yi mfwengululu etu djotsu dji ngenze.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>BaSwife bamawarise mfwengululu owu, na bamavose yiri dingenze.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole ekéghanze va wusu dipateme Felikese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Dipateme amaveghe Pole musughe uvose na amatubule rye: «Nyidjabi yiri wisalisi bunzonzi bwaghu mu bulongu bwetu mu pwele bilime, kaboghu na musighe nyiruyi mu ukéghanze. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Nane wurungulile dikelulile ndebeni, vakavyoghe ne dighumi na bilumbu bibedji, nyimarughe o musyengi Serusaleme, mu ulembiyile Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Vagha mutu amandabe mbure nyitsundi na batu vo urume mughungi mu dimbunge, nesi o ndaghu Nzambi dji baSwife, vo mu musyengi. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Batu bébabe baghorungule ulase dyambu adi béfwengilili. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ne nane, nyidjabi didi va wusu waghu: nyimakéveghe mu Nzile Fumu, adji bévosi yiri duyitsu du mfurulu. Tumbe, nyisalili Nzambi dji baghulu betu, nyivayili yitu mu motsu marendu mu Mabuku ma Mighaghe na ma Babiyitsi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Nyine yitu yi Nzambi orambuse batu botsu o dufu, bakebe baboti vo babi. Na djowu abémfwengilili wandi, bane ditase yi Nzambi obarambuse va ghari abafu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Ladibandu, nyilembinini ube na mutsanu wuwelimine va wusu Nzambi na va wusu batu.»<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Nyisamabe va ghari enu mwa bilime, nyimaghabusile o Serusaleme mu wamuse mukute ami na mbongu, nowakise paghu tsyami ombu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Nyinomane ughabusile paghu, bamantasunu o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi. Vane mbé nyimamane misusu mi manyuru. Vasamabe mughungi nami ne nkumfu. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Tumbe, mwa dibuli di baSwife ba yari yi Asi dimabe vane wandi. Djowu, mbé batsikelase va wusu aghu mu mfwengilile, pa bane dyambu mu menu. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Batu bébabe banzinguli dibi adi nyibile na mbele, adi nzibeghulu va wusu fundu dji banzonzi. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Muvingu yike mbembu adji nzipalise na dwufi dineni, diteli va wusu owu: “Mumbari nyivayili yitu mu durambughulu du abafu, adine nyimabile na nyangu mu bunzonzi va wusu enu!”»<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Felikese, omadjabaange burange motsu ametsuni Nzile Fumu. Amavose na abémumfwengilili yi: «Ave yivunde Lisyase oruyile, nyusosise dyambu dyenu.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Amarume yivunde yi baghore mu kelisa Pole o tsughu, nomusingise dudjeghusu na musughe yiri bambatsi bandi bomusalile.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole va wusu Felikese na Duresile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Mwa bilumbu binovyoghe, Felikese amarughe na mughatsi andi Duresile, omabe muSwife. Amasindighe unengile Pole nowulu adi amavose mu dyambu di yitu mu Djesu Kirisete. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Pole amavosile mu mutsanu wuboti awu Nzambi erondi, ube na murime usunde na mufundu Nzambi awiruyi. Mu temu eni, Felikese, asamalabe ubwedji, amamutsingule rye: «Wurungule uwende. Ave nyudilile temu, nyuwunengile.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Amatase yiri Pole omusumbe na mbongu. Ladibandu, amamunengililaange temu na temu mu vosaange nandi.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Bilime bibedji bimavyoghe, va djulu vane Porekuse Fesetuse amavinze Felikese. Djandi, mu ulase baSwife ubwedji, amasile Pole o tsughu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole ekeghanze va wusu kaghe Fesetuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Va djulu bilumbu biryeru bi durughu dwandi mu musyengi Serusaleme, kaghe Fesetuse amaghusughe o Sesaré na amawende o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na barumitsi ba baSwife bamarughe mu ufundise Pole. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Bamamuwivule ubasingise yese yi ughabuse Pole o Serusaleme. Na vane, bamatunge fundu mu djandi mu muboke mu nzile. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Tumbe Fesetuse amawaghule yiri Pole adji o tsughu o Sesaré, na djabeni aghotambe ughabughe na mapape. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Na amabwele: «Bivunde byenu bisobini konge nami o Sesaré na ghune bafwengilili mutu eni, pa atsisalise dibi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fesetuse amavyose yinane vo dighumi di bilumbu ombu wowu, mbana amaghabughe o musyengi Sesaré. Ave kedi, amatsane o mbure bunzonzi na amaveghe dirume bakebeghe Pole va wusu andi. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Ave bamamubeyile, baSwife abamarughe o Serusaleme bamamutsyengile na bamamufwengilile mambu mapwele, ame djowu baghorungule ulase yi mangenze. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Pole amakéghanze novose rye: «Ngasalise ne dibi dimosi: nesi mu mughaghe baSwife, nesi na ndaghu dji Nzambi, vo na kaghe Sesare.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Fesetuse, omaronde ulase baSwife ubwedji, amawivule Pole: «Wirondi uwende o Serusaleme mu usosusu va wusu ami mu dyambu dyeni?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Pole amawake: «Nyidji va ndaghu bunzonzi dji kaghe Sesare, avane nyutabululu bunzonzi. Ngavayile dibi ombu mukute baSwife, nane ndebeni wididjabili. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Pa nine mbele na ta nyimasalise dyambu adi nyubokulu, ngébusi ufu. Tumbe pa vagha dyambu di ngenze adi batu beni bémfwengilili, vagha mutu avu na musughe wu ukwakise ombu owu. Nyibwayi mbile ombu kaghe Sesare aketabule dyambu dyami.»<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Kaboghu Fesetuse, anotabule dyambu na fundu banzonzi bandi, amawake: «Wumabwa mbile ombu kaghe Sesare, uwende va wusu andi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole epali va wusu Agheripa na Berenise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Mwa bilumbu binovyoghe, kaghe Agheripa na, mwane ngudji andi mughetu Berenise, bamatole o Sesaré mu uyélingulu noyisimbe Fesetuse. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Banotsane mwa bilumbu, Fesetuse amatolise dyambu di Pole ombu kaghe Agheripa: «Vadji mutu vave awu Felikese amasile o tsughu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Ave nyimawendile o Serusaleme, bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu na bivunde bi baSwife, bamamufwengilile na bamankwivule umukilise. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Nyimabawaghule rye: “Bise Rome baghane yufu yuwakise oyifwengululu ombu banzonzi, pa akaveghu temu djukéghanze va wusu bafwengilitsi.” <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Batsirughe ghunu nami. Nyisamavyose temu kulini, nyimatsane va mbure bunzonzi, ave kedi, nyimarume yiri babeyi dibaale dyeni. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Bafwengilitsi batsikélase, tumbe mu fwengululu owu, ngawulu mabi motsu nyimatase. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Babetsi na mitsundu mu dyambu di munongu duyitsu doghu du Nzambi na dibaale dinengulu Djesu adjimafu, adji Pole amatubule yiri aki monyu. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Mu menu, nyimakambulu yari ayi ngabe mu mutsundu eni. Adine nyimamuwivule yeri esingi uwende o Serusaleme, mu usosise dyambu dyandi ghune. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Tumbe Pole amawivule, yiri dyambu dyandi dyutsonzughu mu kake dji kaghe Sesare. Ladibandu, nyimarumine yiri akekelusu o tsughu, tena nyumusindighe ombu kaghe Sesare.»<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agheripa amatsingule Fesetuse rye: «Nyirondi uwulu mebeni mutu eni.» Fesetuse amawaghule yi: «Mughese wumuwulu.» <verse eid="ACT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Ave kedi, Agheripa na Berenise bamarughe na mughungi wuneni wumabayitsaange nobasangile na milolu. Yike djowu, bakekote o ndaghu bunzonzi na bivunde bi baghore na bi musyengi. Mu dirume di Fesetuse, Pole amabeghu. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Mbana kaghe Fesetuse amavose: «Kaghe Agheripa, na djenu botsu aduvu vave netu, dwilabi dibaale dyédidi. Yinombu yotsu yi baSwife yi tsirughe, ubandile o Serusaleme tena ghunu, noghamughe yi mutu eni ayamwébe monyu. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Tumbe menu, nyimalabe yiri asamavaghe dyambu adi mbé ofwile. Va djulu vane, djandi amabwa mbile ombu kaghe Sesare Okisete bwendiri djandi akemusosise. Ladibandu, nyimamutindile ombu kaghe Sesare. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Vave, nyisane dyambu disusu dyusonine yivunde yetu mu mutu éwuwu. Ladibandu, nyimutindili va wusu enu, viri va wusu aghu, ndedju kaghe Agheripa. Pa wune bivu byumuwivule, mba nyube na dyambu dyusone. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Nyilabi yiri digha diwelimine mu utinde mwise tsughu o Rome, ta vagha tonu adjitsiyisi mfwengululu andi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole ekéghanze va wusu kaghe Agheripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Kaghe Agheripa amatsingule Pole: «Wune musughe wu uvose mu kéghanze.» Kaboghu Pole amasambe dikake la nane amakéghanzile. <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>Akevose rye: «Kaghe Agheripa, na muni nyilabi ubwedji mu ukéghanze va wusu aghu, mu motsu ame bivunde bi baSwife bémfwengilili. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Mumbari widjabi burange nzalusulu tsyotsu tsi baghulu ba baSwife na nzundulu owu. Kokolu tsyaghu, nyighulendi kululwati na pughu.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>BaSwife nami botsu bédjabi monyu ami wughulu, ubande bungebi bwami. Bédjabi nane nyimatsanine vane dibandu va ghari mukute ami o Serusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Bénzyabi vane kale na borungule unkabusile bumbedji, pa batsironde. Bédjabi wandi, yiri nyimabeyise monyu ami va ghari mukute ami nodedili mighaghe mi baSwife mi bateme, diwendili yi: ami dibuli di baFarisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Na muni, nyimasutusu va wusu bunzonzi, mumbari nyivayili yitu mu pangini adji Nzambi amavangene na baghulu betu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Dighumi na bibandu bibedji bi mukute etu, bévivi na yitu yiri pangini djuduwusu, ave béyitsili Nzambi na yikanene nyangu na mukolu. Wulwati kaghe Agheripa! Mu dyambu di yitu yeni, baSwife bémfwengilili. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Dibandu yi wumosi va ghari enu, olabile yiri Nzambi aghorungule urambuse djowu abafu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>Mebeni, nyimatase utoyise Djesu mwise Nasarete na mangolu mami. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Yine, adine nyimavaghe mu batu ba Djesu abamabe o Serusaleme. Nyimadile musughe wu muvingu na bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu, na nyimakotise yinombu yi djowu bango yitu mu djandi o tsughu. Ave bamaveyilaange musughe wu uboke batu beni, nyimabawarisaange. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Temu na temu, nyimavyoghaange mu mandaghu mowu ma tsambu, na nyimabakilisaange mbana nyimabaghome ubunze yitu yowu. Mu bukanyi bwami, nyimabakwanaange tena misyengi mi beni.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole evosi yilombi yi dughobutsu dwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Anane nyimawendile o musyengi Damase oyésale yisalu, mu durumu na musughe abimapeghu na bivunde bi bavaghulitsi ba paghu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Kaghe Agheripa, nyimabe mu nzile, mwangulu ave nyimalabile yidjalale yineni ayimaruyile o djulu, uvyolile ne nyangu. Yidjalale yeni yimavedemaange mba yiketughumbe, menu na balinzi nami. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Djetu botsu tumaberughe vatsi na nyimawulu dyufi dimavose mu mbembu baEberu: “Sole, Sole, dibandu yi winkwanini? Wa mwenzile wiwarili, nane yibulu ewarili na ngwangu fumu andi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Nyimawivule: “Nde la nyi, Fumu?” Na Fumu amakwaghule: “Menu la Djesu, awu wikwani. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Tumbe simbughe na releme, nyimalabene naghu, nyimawusole mu ube musatsi ami. Wube mbedji ami mu usamune nane wutsilabile na ame nyuwulase o wusu. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Nyuwughobule va ghari mukute aghu, baSwife na mikute misusu ami nyuwusindiyile. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Nyiwusindiyi mu ubadibule misu, mu ubarambuse o piseme nobaghabuse o yidjalale, na mu ubadusule otsi durumu du Dyabu na mu ubakotise o bundumbe bu Nzambi. Pa batsimpayile yitu, mabi mowu motandu, bodile mbure na djowu abamatsyemusu mu yitu mu menu.”»<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole evosi mu dyambu di yisalu ayi Nzambi amamuveghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Fumu ami Agheripa, va djulu vane, nyisamalenze dirume di yiryaryamu ayimaruyile o djulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Tumbe téteghe, nyimalonze bise Damase na bise Serusaleme, na djowu abavu o yinange yi Sudé, tena batu ba malongu masusu. Nyimabatsingule yiri: “Kalughanu mutsanu enu, na ghélughanu ombu Nzambi na lasanu dukalughu dwenu mu bisalu byenu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Ladibandu, baSwife bamakangile ave nyimabile o dulombili du ndaghu Nzambi na bamaronde umboke. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Tumbe Nzambi amakaghe tena yilumbu yéyiyi na nyidji vave mu uveghe bumbedji bwami ombu botsu: bagheyi na baneni. Ngévosi masusu yike ame babiyitsi na Moyise bamatubule yiri morughe. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Diwendili yiri: Yibyatsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yibyatsi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">diwendili yiri Kirisete, djandi o Nzambi amasole mube Kaghe mukute andi.</char></note> yi Nzambi otsoghe, obe awuteghe mu urambughe va ghari abafu na oyesamune yidjalale yi dughobutsu ombu mukute etu, nombu malongu masusu.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole elendi Kaghe Agheripa akevayile yitu ombu Djesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Ave Pole amavosilaange mu kéghanze, Fesetuse amaghamughe: «Nde wumalawughe, Pole! Wumawidji pwele, la dibandu wumalawuyile.» <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Pole amamuwake rye: «Menu nga dilaghu, mundumbe Fesetuse. Bighume abinyipalisi bingenze tsi mavovose. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Kaghe Agheripa amadjabaange dyambu di Djesu adimavyoghe, adine mewandi ni divosili na musighe va wusu andi. Dyambu dyeni dimavyole va misu mandi, nine yitu bwé vagha yime ayi mbé aghorungule udjabe. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Kaghe Agheripa, nde wivayili yitu mu motsu amamabighu na babiyitsi? Nyidjabi yiri wimavayili yitu!»<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agheripa amatsingule Pole rye: «Witasi wupaghe Kereti, mu mwa pesu temu nane?» <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pole amawaghule: «Dikebe na mapape vo vane wusu, nyisambili Nzambi tsike mu nde pinze, tumbe na botsu abénkulu na nyangu, dube nane menu, uvinguse bapange beni babe nyikapulu.»<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Kaghe na dipateme di musyengi, Berenise na botsu abamabe vane, bamareleme. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Banokakene, bamatsingusene djobeni na djobeni: «Mutu éwuwu aghavaghe dibi adyumurombise dufu nokotusu o tsughu.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Na Agheripa amatsingule Fesetuse: «Mutu éwuwu turungule umudjeyise, mbé agharonde yiri kaghe Sesare aketabule dyambu dyandi.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole amatindu o musyengi Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Dinotabulu yiri tuwende mu watange o bulongu bu Yitali, Pole na bise tsughu bamosi, bamawakusu yivunde yi baghore ba Rome, dine dyandi Sulyuse, yivunde mu dibuli di «Batoyitsi ba Kaghe.» <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Tumanangeme mu watange dji Aderamite, adjimawendesenaange o yisyeni yi Asi, na tumawende. Arisitareke, mwise Masedwane dji Tesalonike, amabe netu. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Va kedi tumatole o musyengi Sidone. Sulyuse, omakélisaange Pole na musighe, amamusingise uwende ombu bambatsi bandi, mu udile ayi amabe na nzale. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Tunoghusughe vane, tumanangeme mu watange novyoyile mu mughule ningi dji Sipere o yari ayi punge djisamabe djivyoghulile, mumbari djimaruyilaange o wusu yetu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Tunosabughe mubu beli na bulongu bu Silisi na Pafili, na tumatole o musyengi Mire wu Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Vane, yivunde yi baghore ba Rome yimarasunu watange dji Alesanderi, adjimawendaange o bulongu bu Yitali na amatunangise mune.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Mu pwele bilumbu, tumawendaange va ghéghéyi. Na maghughe maneni, tumarungulile utole va wusu musyengi Sinide. Tumbe punge djimatuvurise mu uwende na wusu. Tumavyoyile va dinzongi di Salmoné, teno divengi di ningi dji Kerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Tumawende na maghughe maneni mu mughule disimu na tumatole va mbure djinengule «Masabu Maboti», beli na musyengi Lasé.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Mulingu etu tena vave wumabonge pwele bilumbu. Va djulu vane, dimabe divure uwende mu watange na wusu. Yilumbu yimanegulu «yuwarile nzale» mbé yimavyoge. Kale yilime mu temu eni, punge djimabande uvotse pwele. Ladibandu, Pole amalubusili basalitsi ba watange: <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Bambatsi bami, nyilabi yiri mulingu wurange. Watange na bime byudyame na djetubeni wandi turungulu utsyemuse myoni.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Tumbe yivunde yi baghore amavayile yitu mu munu fumu watange na mubeyitsi djoni, divyakene na mbembu Pole. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Va djulu vane, bapwele abamabe mu watange bamawulusunu mu wusughe vane, mumbari yisyeni yeni yisamabe yiwelimine mu vyosile mvule. Bamaronde utole o yisyeni yi Fenikese dji Kerete, o yari ayi mupunge wughépepili pwele, ayisungesene na awu wisi etsimini. Bamaronde usyale vane, tena mvule djuvyoyile.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungudi wumarombise Pole usanze nzile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Mwa dupepi du bande dumavughe, bamatase udughusu mulingu owu. Na bamanyangule kunge adjimaghanga watange<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kunge adjimaghanga watange: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yime yitsire ayisikiyi watange, mumbari mibidji mikéwubeghe.</char></note> na bamavyoghe va mughule disimu di Kerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Tumbe, punge djineni adjinengulu «Yirakilone», djimasundughe o mikongu mi ningi. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Watange djimavevughe: dimabe divure mu djibeyise dibandu mungudi, tena tumakesilile ubeghusu. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Tumavyoyile o bande ningi djigheyi djinengulu Koda, o disimu adi mupunge wusamabe mangolu, ave tumadilile yivumunu mwa pesu. Va djulu vane, na purulu tsipwele tumarungule usiyighe bwatu bugheyi abutungu mu watange. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Basatsi banodute bwatu, bamabunangule na bamabunangighe o ghari watange, mbana bamavyose mikudu otsi notsyengise watange mu udji warise. Bamadumaange uyékébwaghe mu maghuki ma yisyeke ma Sirete amamabe mu yisyeni yi Lybi, la dibandu bamasundusile kunge mu udetse mwendu watange. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Yilumbu ayimaduke, Mungudi wumabwela utupupise na mangolu, la dibandu basatsi bamabande ubwaghe dikabu di maboti amamabe mu watange mu mubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Yilumbu ayimuryeru, bamabwaghe na makake mowu, bisalulu bi watange. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Mu bilumbu bipwele, tusamamwélabaange ne nyangu, ne bambwuélili. Punge djimavyoghulile uvepe na mangolu. Na va djulu vane, tukane yitu yughobulu.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Mu temu eni djine, botsu abamabe mu watange, mbé bakeyitsingu yineni nodji. Kaboghu Pole, amareleme va wusu owu na amavose: «Bambatsi bami, mbé dumakululu na mbé dusamarambughe o ningi Kerete, mungudi mbé usamadubembe na mbé tughatsyemuse nobunge bimi. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Tumbe vave, nyidunengili mu ube na duwarusu, mumbari vaghobe ne wumosi awutsyemuse monyu. Muvingu yike watange adjubungene. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Mu mukolu eni, yanze yi Nzambi adji ndile na adji nyisalili, yike bambene nami. <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>Na yitsinzingule: “Wuyalabe ghome, Pole! Vengu wuvyoghe va wusu kaghe Sesare. Mu maboti mandi mu ndedju, Nzambi ewusingisi monyu batu botsu abavu naghu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Banu abaware, bambatsi bami, mumbari nyine yitu mu Nzambi. Dyube nane dimanzingululu. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Watange djudyame ave tubile beli na mwa ningi.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Dimabe mukolu awu dighumi na mwina (14) bi mungudi wumatusindilaange o mubu wu Méditerane. Beli va ghari wisi, basalitsi ba watange bamatase yiri tuke beli na butambe. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Bamawélighe ndonge na bamalabe yiri mambe mamabe madonge mu maghumi-maryeru na yisambwali (37) yi byetsu. Mwa pesu o wusu, bamamwéwélighe na bamalabe maghumi ma bedji na yinane (28) yi byetsu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Bamadumange yiri watange djikéwubene mu dimani. Ladibandu, bamabwayile kunge djine o nzime mu udetse mwendu watange na bakevivaange ditebughulu di wisi.<verse eid="ACT 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Ne nane, basalitsi bamaronde urine mu watange. La dibandu, bamasunduse bwatu mu mambe na bakerombe yighume yusunzile kunge o wusu watange. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Pole amatsingule yivunde na baghore basuse: «Pa batu bébaba baghatsane o ghari watange, dughorungulu ughobulu!» <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Kaboghu, baghore bamatabule mikudu amimasikigha watange na bamabusile uvevughe.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Ne wisi uketébughe, Pole amabarume udji, novose rye: «Lanu, na muni dighumi na bilumbu bina (14), dwivivili na manyoni ughambu udji. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Nyiduwarisi mu ubonge bighudji, mumbari dune nzale byonyi dukeghobulu. Vaghobe ne mutu wumosi awutsyemuse ne dunange dumosi du muru!»<verse eid="ACT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Anomane uvose, Pole amabonge dipe, amaghabusile Nzambi diboti va wusu botsu, mbana amabaghabile na amabande udji. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Botsu bamadile duwarusu, na djowu bamadji. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Tumabe mu watange, kame-bedji maghumi dusambwali na batu ba syamunu (276) mu botsu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Ave mutu-mutu amamanine udji na uwukuru, bamabwaghe byotsu abimasyale mu bakomi o mubu mu lengsene watange.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Watange djimapumughe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Wisi wunotebughe, basalitsi ba watange basamamwédjabe ningi, tumbe bamalabile dukweku na bamaghane kake mu utsyekighe watange mu yisyeyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Bamanyangule kunge na bamadjisile uwende mu mubu. Bamanyangule va mosi mikudu mi yivepi. Na bamatunge tsande o wusu watange, yiri punge odjisindile na bamawendusu o dukweku. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Tumbe bamatole va yinzunze yi yisyeyi na watange djimasikeme. Wusu watange wukekote mu yisyeyi na djisamamwékunge, matine mamapanzighe na mangolu ma mibidji.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Baghore bamaronde uboke bise tsughu, yiri ne wumosi aghodile urine noryale. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Tumbe yivunde yi baghore, na nzale ughobule Pole, amabaghandise. Amarume botsu abédjabi uryale, bareli mu mambe mu usabughe o disimu. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Bane bamabadukaange banangeme va djulu tsimbi na basusu bamaryalaange ubongile ghune watange. Anane djetu botsu tumaghobuyile.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Pole va ningi dji Malete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Tunoghobulu, tumadjabe yiri ningi eni adjitumabe, djinengulu Malete. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Bise ningi abasamavosaange mbembu Ngereke bamatudile na musighe. Mvule djimamwénoghe na wumabe yotsi, kaboghu bamabanze mudji wuneni na bamatudile djetu botsu. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Pole anoboole dighuki di batsyenzu mu utume o mudji, pili djimapale na mbabisile na djimaghobe mu dikake dyandi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Ave bise ningi bamalabile pili djivyunge mu dikake di Pole, bamatsingusene yi: «Dibaale dyédidi adji yikongu, mumbari bunzonzi bu Nzambi bughémusingisi udile monyu, ne nana atsighobululu mu mubu.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Tumbe Pole amanyaghule nyoghe o ghari mudji, ne udile bwali. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Bamatasa yiri orande vo ufu, tumbe banokélise yitsingu. Bamalabe yiri aghédili dyambu, bamavinze posulu novose, kaboghu adji wumosi va ghari banyambi.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Beli na mbure eni vamabe kande dji yivunde yi ningi, dibaale dine dyandi Publyuse. Djandi amatudile burange na amatulatse bilumbu biryeru. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Tadji Publyuse amabe va tangi, amabe na dibaghu na amavanze malungu. Pole amawende ombu wandi, anosambile Nzambi, amamusakighe makake na djandi amabelughe. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Va djulu vane, batu basusu ba ningi abamabe nobele, bamarughe na bamabelughe. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Bamatughobise mu minongu myotsu. Temu djuwende mu watange djinotole, bamatuveghe byotsu abimabe biwelimine na mulingu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole amatole o musyengi Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Miweli miryeru minovyoghe, tumanaangeme mu watange dji Alesanderi, bamanengilaange «Mavase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mavase: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nyambi bedji tsi mavase ma baNgereke. </char></note>», djimavyose mvule va yisyeni yi ningi. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Tumatole o musyengi Sirakuse, avane tumatsane bilumbu biryeru. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Tunoghusughe vane, tumaduke mughule tena tumatole o musyengi Redjo. Ave kedi, punge adji bande dji mapepe, mbana tumatole mu bilumbu bibedji tena o musyengi Puzole otumasunduyile. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Mune musyengi eni, tumadale baane ba ngudji, bamatulende uvyose tsone nowu. Anane tumatolile o bulongu bu Rome. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Baane ba ngudji ba Rome banowulu bilumbi mu dyambu dyetu, bamayitubengusune va dibaghe dinengulu «Apyuse» na musyengi winengulu «Mandaghu Maryeru ma Beni». Pole anobalabe, amaghabusile Nzambi diboti na amawarusu. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Tunotole o Rome, bamasingise Pole ube na djandi mbure vike, na ghore adjimamukelisaange.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pole esamunyi Musamu Wuboti o bulongu bu Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Bilumbu biryeru binovyoghe, Pole amanengile ombu wandi bivunde bi baSwife abavu o Rome. Banoghukeme, amabatsingule: «Bane batadji, ne nane nyisamavayile dyambu divyakene na mutsanu mukute etu vo na nzalusulu dji baghulu betu. Ne nane, nyimaghangu o Serusaleme, nowakusu ombu bise Rome. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Banonkwivule byuvu, basusu mbé baronde undunde, mumbari basamadile dyambu mu menu adyumfundisile vo dyumbokile. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Tumbe barumitsi ba baSwife bamabuse, kaboghu nyimanengile Kaghe Sesare. Nyisamabe na ditase dyufwengilili bise bulongu bwami. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Ladibandu, nyimarondile ubengunu nenu no duvosile. Va djulu vane, nyitungu na bapange beni babe, dibandu djandi awu mukute Yisrayele wivivi.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Bamamuwawule rye: «Tusamadile mighande mi Sudé mu dyambu dyaghu, ne mwane tadji mosi asamarughesene ghune, mu ututsingule mambu vo mu uvosile dibi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Tumbe, twirondi wuketutsingule ndebeni dyambu adi witasi, mumbari twidjabi yiri mbure tsyotsu, wudji batu bévosi dibi mu nde.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Bamavangene na Pole, na yilumbu yi ndayi, bamarughe yinombu yineni nomurasune va mbure adji amatsanine. Ubande kedi tena tsisighe, Pole amabavindiyile mambu. Amabasamunine Bukaghe bu Nzambi, amarombe ubasungighe mu dyambu di Djesu, na akerangaange na dyufi dineni, mighaghe mi Moyise na mabuku ma Babiyitsi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Bamosi bamabembu na mambu ame amavosaange, tumbe basusu bamabuse umavayile yitu. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Ave bamabandile uwende ughambu uwulusunu, Pole amabatsingule didi rye: «Yinyuni Yisyeme yimabe na ndunge, ave amavosilaange na baghulu benu mu munu mubiyitsi Yisayi! <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>Yimavosaange rye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Yétsingule mukute éwuwu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Duwulu, tumbe dughotsiyise.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Dughengile, tumbe dugholabe.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Mumbari mukute éwuwu wuke mbike.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bamadibighe matudji, bamatsimise misu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">yiri bakélabe na misu mowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bakéwulu na matudji mowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">bakétsiyise na mirime myowu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ubuse nane, mbé boghabughe ombu wami, yiri nyubabeluse<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Pole amabwese rye: «Djabanu didi Nzambi amatinde musamu wu dughobutsu ombu abagha baSwife. Bomuwululu djowu!» [ <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Mu bighume byeni bi Pole, baSwife bamawende notsundaange va ghari owu.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Pole amatsane mipume mibedji mu ndaghu adji amafutaange. Amadile botsu abamarondaange umulabe. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Amalonzaange Bukaghe bu Nzambi na mambu ameghéngili Fumu Djesu Kirisete, na musighe wughambu ukungusu.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
